window.AKK_FREELOADING_DAILY_BUT_THE_SYSTEM_MAKES_ME_A_BIG_SPENDER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FREELOADING_DAILY_BUT_THE_SYSTEM_MAKES_ME_A_BIG_SPENDER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: It's Just a Flop, So Why Is the Whole Internet Begging to Be My Apprentice","paragraphs":["Content warnings:","Brain-checking station (✿╹◡╹)","1. The online and real-life portions are portrayed in a 1:1 ratio.","2. The amounts of money get pretty outrageous later on.","3. All the male leads are completely clean.","4. Every platform has different burner accounts, and there are lots of aliases.","5. Every type of livestreaming will make an appearance, though voice-chat rooms will get the most attention.","6. The heroine has multiple men on the go at once. Now that she has a tycoon system, sticking to a one-on-one relationship would be a waste of such a cheat.","The light from the phone screen flickered across Gu Lan’s face.","Her private messages and comment section on Douyin had been completely overrun.","Half the comments came from indignant self-appointed justice warriors, condemning her for playing with people’s feelings and calling her nothing short of a shameless heartbreaker.","The other half... had taken a rather strange turn.","[Girl, I don’t care how you managed to date two guys at once. I just want to know how you got two streamers completely obsessed with you without spending a single cent.]","[I spent over eighty thousand yuan on my favorite streamer and couldn’t even get a private-message friend slot. Can you teach me how to freeload like you? I’ll pay!]","[Please, I want a tutorial too! I feel like I’ve been watching livestreams wrong all this time—and wasting my money. So this is what high-level gameplay looks like?]","[I spent hundreds of thousands and didn’t even get to hold his hand! What does that make me?]","[It makes you rich.]","Expressionless, Gu Lan scrolled through the screen. Her fingertip lightly tapped the comments asking for a tutorial before she quickly swiped past them.","Both streamers had blocked her.","One was a singer, the other a dancer.","One had a gorgeous face, the other an incredible voice.","She had spent an entire summer painstakingly winning them over, wheedling and coaxing until she finally got them interested. Then, because of an unexpected cross-room PK battle, all her hard work had gone up in smoke.","How heartbreaking.","Gu Lan pursed her lips. The unhappiness in her heart was less heartbreak than the fury of having a carefully cultivated game save suddenly deleted.","As for the people cursing her, she filtered them out automatically. The ones begging for a tutorial, however, gave her a strange sense of smug satisfaction.","They wanted to learn?","This wasn’t something anyone could master just by studying. Talent was required.","She couldn’t stay on this platform anymore—or at least not for a while.","Gu Lan sighed and dug through a pile of flashy game apps until she found a plain-looking one: Oxygen Voice.","She had downloaded it ages ago but never used it once.","She might as well use this little no-name platform as a temporary refuge.","Once the app finished downloading and updating, she began registering a new account with practiced ease.","Username: Food Liu You.","Profile picture: an abstract, crookedly drawn picture of Lazy Goat that looked both depressed and obnoxious.","Done.","The moment she tapped “Complete,” an electronic voice that clearly did not come from her phone’s speakers exploded inside her head.","[Ding—]","[Host detected exhibiting stingy heartbreaker behavior. Qualification for binding confirmed.]","Gu Lan’s hand froze around her phone.","Was she hallucinating? Had staying up too late finally fried her brain?","[Online Tycoon System 3.0—Simp Edition—activating...]","[Activation successful!]","The voice rang out again, crystal clear this time, with a barely suppressed excitement, like a chatterbox who had finally found someone to unload on.","[Hello, Host! I’m your personal System 3.0. You can call me San-chan! In light of your previous “only take, never give” behavior, this system will help you turn over a new leaf and become the most popular big-spending queen on the internet!]","Gu Lan: “...”","What the hell?","“Only take, never give”?","Was this thing calling her stingy?","Before she could even finish complaining internally, the chatty system spilled out all the rules like beans from a broken pod.","[The rules are very simple! Whenever you spend money online on a male with a score of eighty or above in looks, you’ll receive a one-to-one cash rebate!]","[Spend money on an absolutely gorgeous man with a looks score of ninety or above, and you’ll receive a one-to-ten cash rebate!]","[The looks score will be automatically determined by the system’s backend. Fair and impartial! Host, forget the penny-pinching version of yourself and embark on your path to becoming a tycoon!]","Spend money?","On men?","Gu Lan’s first reaction was resistance. What kind of joke was this? Her motto in life was, “Freeloading is king.”","Asking her to spend money was practically the same as asking her to die.","But...","A one-to-ten rebate?","That number circled through her mind, and its meaning instantly changed.","If she sent a super-handsome guy ten thousand yuan in gifts, the system would give her one hundred thousand in return? She’d make a net profit of ninety thousand?","This... wasn’t spending money at all. It was making money!","And it was the ultimate way to get rich by turning nothing into something!","Gu Lan’s thoughts began to race.","She could use someone else’s money to pursue the handsome men she wanted, and in the end, the money would still end up in her own pocket.","Was there anything more wonderful in the world?","“Not bad,” she murmured, tentatively acknowledging the pie that had fallen from the sky.","[Host, would you like to accept the binding? Countdown: ten, nine...]","“Accept.” Gu Lan didn’t hesitate.","Anyone who refused free money was an idiot.","[Binding successful! Best wishes on your spending spree, Host. May you become a wealthy woman soon!]","The system’s voice cheerfully faded away.","Gu Lan turned her attention back to the phone screen.","The Oxygen Voice app’s homepage was extremely simple. Row after row of rooms filled the screen, divided into all sorts of categories.","[Songs on Request], [Voice Acting], [Emotional Radio], [Voice Chat & Dating].","It was an entirely different world from the Douyin she had used before.","Most of the streamers here never showed their faces. Their cover images were either anime-style handsome men, scenic views, or abstract avatars like hers.","How was she supposed to find men with looks scores of eighty or ninety?","Was this system deliberately making things difficult for her?","There was no way she could throw money at an anime avatar without knowing who was behind it. What if the person on the other side turned out to be a hairy middle-aged man? Who would she even complain to then?","Irritably scratching at her hair, Gu Lan decided to start with the most popular room.","She entered a room tagged [Goodnight Melodies], where the number of viewers was displayed as 99+.","The moment she entered, a noisy wave of excitement slammed into her.","A young man was belting out a popular love song over the public mic. Not only was he singing wildly off-key—somewhere around Siberia—he also seemed completely convinced that he sounded amazing. Every note dragged on forever.","A crowd of young girls flooded the public chat with messages like “You’re amazing, big brother!” and “Your singing is so beautiful!” The free flower gifts flashed across the screen almost nonstop.","Gu Lan’s ears suffered severe occupational damage.","This was the platform’s most popular room?","Her opinion of the platform’s average quality plummeted instantly.","With a voice like that, he would have been hunted down by the entire voice-lover community she belonged to.","Just as she was preparing to pinch her nose and leave the room, a clear yet slightly lazy male voice came through the public mic.","The voice wasn’t particularly loud or soft, but it seemed to carry a magnetic hook. It pierced through the surrounding noise and slipped precisely into her ears.","“All right, thank you to Mic One for that deeply heartfelt performance. It was very... spirited.”","He paused, as though carefully choosing his words. In the end, he settled on “spirited,” a trace of laughter concealed in the lingering note of his voice.","“Next up—friend on mic two, are you there?”","Gu Lan’s finger, poised to click the exit button, froze in midair.","Her entire body went still.","That voice...","It was incredible.","It was practically tailor-made to hit every one of her voice-crush sweet spots.","The TikTok disaster, the infuriating comments, and that money-draining system—all of it was instantly banished to the farthest reaches of her mind.","There was only one thought left in her head.","He had to be mine."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: The plot of looking down on level 0 low-level accounts, though late, still arrives","paragraphs":["Gu Lan stood frozen in place as though someone had cast a petrification spell on her. Even her breathing instinctively grew lighter.","That clear, mellow male voice didn’t speak again. Another person took over the public mic and began singing another sugary little love song of unknown origin.","But Gu Lan’s ears had already blocked out every other sound automatically.","Her mind kept replaying that one sentence from moments ago:","“Very... spirited.”","The slight pause, the lazy smile hidden in the lilt of his voice—every tiny detail landed precisely on all her weak spots, teasing an itch in her heart.","She silently lingered in the room like a leopard hiding in the grass, patiently waiting for its prey.","She wasn’t in a hurry.","The more exceptional the prey, the more patience it required.","Minute after minute passed. The songs on the public mic changed one after another, and Gu Lan’s patience was nearly worn away by all the screeching and howling.","Just as she was about to visit another room, a private-message notification popped up at the top of her phone.","It was a message from the Oxygen app.","She opened it and saw that it had been sent by someone with the ID “Wn.Qing.”","[Wn.Qing: Sis, would you like to hear a song? I can sing pop songs, and I’m not too bad.]","Gu Lan raised an eyebrow.","That opening line... was far too plain.","It sounded exactly like something a rookie would say—he didn’t even know how to come up with a decent sales pitch. Back when she used Douyin, streamers went all-out trying to attract attention. Their copywriting had become so elaborate it was practically an art form.","“A newcomer?” she wondered.","Still, someone taking the initiative was better than no one at all.","Gu Lan’s thoughts shifted, and she called for the system in her head.","“San-chan, get out here and do some work. Check the looks of this ‘Wn.Qing’ and that host from earlier, ‘Wn.Xu.’”","[Ding! Appearance assessment in progress...]","[Wn.Qing, appearance score: 81. The host may receive a 1:1 rebate on the user’s spending.]","[Wn.Xu, appearance score: 90. The host may receive a 1:10 rebate on the user’s spending.]","Ninety points! A tenfold rebate!","Gu Lan’s heart gave a sharp thump.","Her ears hadn’t deceived her after all! Someone with a voice this incredible absolutely had to be good-looking too!","As for Qing... 81 points was barely passing, and his rebate was only one-to-one.","Even a tiny mosquito was still meat.","Besides, Qing was the only one who had taken the initiative to contact her.","In the past, she hadn’t had any money and could only sit in the audience, watching other people lavish fortunes on handsome men.","But now...","Gu Lan’s thoughts went around in countless twists and turns, and a mischievous smile slowly curled across her lips.","Times had changed. Now that she had money, it was finally the handsome men’s turn to fawn over her.","She leisurely typed a reply to Qing.","[Food Liu You: This is my first time using this, so I don’t really understand (。•『•。).]","Playing dumb was a woman’s innate talent.","After sending the message, she asked the system again, “San-chan, I can’t actually be spending my own money, can I?”","The system’s cheerful voice immediately rang out:","[The unlimited black card has been credited! The card number has been automatically saved to your mobile wallet. Please bind it and recharge as needed!]","Gu Lan immediately exited the app. Sure enough, she found a black card she had never seen before in her mobile wallet. There was no bank logo on it—only a string of numbers shimmering with rainbow-colored light.","She skillfully copied the card number, returned to the Oxygen app’s recharge page, selected the highest amount, pasted in the number, and entered the password.","[Recharge successful! Your account has received 1,000,000 diamonds. (Exchange rate: 1 diamond = 0.01 yuan.)]","Ten thousand yuan in exchange for one million diamonds.","Looking at that long string of zeroes, Gu Lan nodded in satisfaction.","She’d test the waters first.","When she returned to the “Goodnight Melody” room, a round of mic rotations had just ended.","That clear, mellow male voice she couldn’t stop thinking about rang out once more.","“All right, the mic rotation is over. Sisters lurking in the background, does anyone else want to request a song?”","It was him! It was Xu!","Gu Lan’s heartbeat skipped, and she hurriedly typed in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: How do I request a song? (confused).jpg]","Xu’s voice carried a smile as he was about to explain. “To request a song, just find the—”","Before he could finish, a dazzling gift animation suddenly exploded across the screen.","A gigantic pink “Love Confession Balloon” slowly rose into view, taking up half the screen.","[Strawberry Cheesecake sent Wn.Muzhi a Love Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds = 520 yuan)]","Immediately afterward, another somewhat urgent male voice forced its way in, cutting Xu off.","“Thanks for the Love Confession Balloon, Sis Cheesecake! Mwah! You’re spoiling me, Sis! Sorry, Brother Xu, I’m going to sing a song for my sis first.”","It was the one called Muzhi.","Gu Lan stared at the public chat. After being interrupted, Xu didn’t say anything else, and the entire public mic was soon taken over by Muzhi and Strawberry Cheesecake’s interaction.","Gu Lan pouted.","So this was what cutting in line looked like.","A wealthy older sister really was something else.","She wasn’t angry, though. Instead, she cheerfully continued typing in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: Wow, so lucky! I get to listen for free.]","She put on an innocent, clueless act.","Just then, another private message lit up.","It was from Xu.","[Wn.Xu: Find the “Request a Song” gift worth 3,320 diamonds in the gift list, choose the host you want to request it from, and send it. That’s all.]","He had even attached a screenshot of the gift list, with the “Request a Song” gift clearly circled.","Oh, he was pretty considerate.","Gu Lan’s impression of Xu improved a little more.","[Food Liu You: Got it! Thank you!]","[Food Liu You: (Thank you).jpg]","She returned to the room. Muzhi had already started singing.","Gu ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌‍Lan patiently listened for two lines.","How should she put it? He had some technical skill, but his singing felt greasy. Every vocal flourish carried the deliberate air of someone saying, “Hurry up and praise how handsome I am.”","Compared with Xu’s clear, natural voice, it was practically a public execution.","Gu Lan, who was used to hearing divine-level singers on Douyin, really couldn’t bear to listen any longer.","She exited the room without hesitation.","She’d come back after this Muzhi finished singing.","She had no interest in wasting her time on singing of this caliber.","At the same time Gu Lan left the room, a new message appeared in a WeChat group called “Goodnight Melody Lineup.”","[Wn.Xu: @Wn.Muzhi, next time, wait until I’ve finished explaining how to request a song before interrupting.]","The group fell silent for a few seconds.","Then someone named Wn.Yechen jumped in.","[Wn.Yechen: Oh, come on, Brother Xu, don’t be mad. Brother Muzhi was only thinking about the room’s revenue. Look, Sis Cheesecake even sent gifts.]","Yechen sent another message.","[Wn.Yechen: That Food Liu You person is a level-zero account. Who knows whether she’ll actually spend anything? It’s more important to take care of big spenders like Sis Cheesecake.]","[Wn.Muzhi: Sis Cheesecake never cut in line when she used to watch Brother Xu. I spoiled her too much. Sorry.]","[Wn.Ears: Oho, showing off now, are we?]"]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: I heard you can cut in line if you have money Then let me casually cut in line","paragraphs":["Gu Lan was idly browsing the Oxygen app.","She clicked into several of the most popular voice rooms and listened to a few so-called “heavenly voices,” only to be sorely disappointed.","Some had such heavy voice effects that they sounded obviously fake. Others were oily and affected, twisting every word into eighteen different flourishes.","Not one of them could compare to Xu.","That man’s voice was like mint soda chilled in the height of summer—crisp, clean, with a faint, barely perceptible laziness in its bubbles.","Just listening to him was soothing.","After wandering around for a while, Gu Lan failed to find any suitable substitute and could only slink back to the “Goodnight Melody” room.","The moment she entered, she heard a commotion on the microphones.","Muzhi had already finished singing and was chatting animatedly with the woman nicknamed Strawberry Cheesecake.","“Cheesecake Sis, the avatar frame and chat bubble you’re using today are so pretty!”","“Of course they are. My Cheesecake Sis looks good in everything!” a man’s ingratiating voice immediately chimed in. It belonged to Yechen.","Gu Lan listened for a moment, feeling rather bored.","She wanted to hear Xu speak.","But aside from those two, all the other hosts connected to the microphones were sitting in complete silence, as if they had turned invisible.","Just as she was about to leave the room running while she scrolled through short videos, two messages suddenly appeared on the public chat.","[Wn.Xu: @Food Liu You, welcome back.]","[Wn.Qing: @Food Liu You, welcome back, Sis.]","Gu Lan froze.","They... remembered her?","She was only a level-zero alt account, and she had just left the room without saying a word.","She looked at the two names on the public chat. One was refined and clear, the other youthful and fresh. For some reason, she found them exceptionally pleasing to the eye.","Then she glanced at Muzhi, who was still chattering away and fawning over the older woman on the microphone. A mischievous idea suddenly popped into Gu Lan’s head.","She leisurely opened her gift inventory.","The diamonds she had just purchased were still gleaming.","She found the “Confession Balloon,” a gift worth 52,000 diamonds.","Then, without hurry, she selected two recipients at once: Wn.Xu and Wn.Qing.","Confirm. Send.","The next second—","“...and I’m telling you, Cheesecake Sis, she...”","Muzhi’s voice cut off abruptly on the microphone.","It was as though someone had strangled him.","The entire screen was swallowed by two enormous special effects exploding one after another.","Magnificent pink balloons carrying hearts slowly rose into the air. The animation was exquisite yet domineering, taking up everyone’s field of vision.","[Food Liu You sent Wn.Xu a Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds)]","[Food Liu You sent Wn.Qing a Confession Balloon x1 (52,000 diamonds)]","The public chat fell into deathly silence for a moment before exploding.","[Wn.Ears: !!! Holy crap! Thank you, my Food Liu You Sis, for sending Confession Balloons to Brother Xu and Qing! What a generous boss! May you make a fortune!]","[Wn.Volcano: Thank you, Sis, for supporting Xu and Qing! Sis, you’re incredible!]","[Wn.Yechen: Thank you, Sis...]","The hosts connected to the microphones seemed to have been switched on by some invisible button. One after another, they began thanking her, each speaking faster than the last, afraid of falling behind by even half a second.","As for the newcomer named Qing, this was the first time he had received such a huge gift. His voice was trembling.","“Th-thank you... Thank you, Food Liu You Sis, for the Confession Balloon... I, I...” He repeated “I” for a long while, too excited to get a coherent sentence out.","The little fans in the public chat went even crazier.","[Squid Strips: Aaaaaaaaaah! Our Xu finally has a big spender! Is this real?! Am I dreaming?!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: Exactly! Two 520 gifts! That’s over a thousand yuan! Sis, are you still looking for a leg ornament?]","[Little Wimp: What kind of goddess is this? She comes in and blows up the screen right away!]","Amid the chaos and astonishment, Gu Lan leisurely typed a message into the public chat, adding an innocent-looking sticker at the end.","[Food Liu You: So, does this mean I get to cut in line now? (confused).jpg]","The moment the message appeared, the noisy chorus of thanks from the microphones came to an abrupt halt again.","Everyone caught the unmistakable sarcasm in her words.","Wasn’t she copying what Muzhi had just done—using a gift to forcibly interrupt someone else?","And doing it right in front of everyone, slapping him squarely in the face.","Muzhi’s microphone remained lit, but he did not make another sound.","Gu Lan could practically imagine how ugly his expression must be.","She was in an excellent mood.","That felt much better.","[Ding! The host has spent 520 yuan on the 90-point-attractiveness streamer “Wn.Xu,” triggering a 1:10 cashback reward. A cashback of 5,200 yuan has been credited!]","[Ding! The host has spent 520 yuan on the 81-point-attractiveness streamer “Wn.Qing,” triggering a 1:1 cashback reward. A cashback of 520 yuan has been credited!]","The system’s notification rang out in her mind, making the curve of Gu Lan’s lips grow even wider.","She had spent a thousand yuan and earned more than five thousand back.","Not bad at all.","In the public chat, some confused fans were still marveling.","[Four-Leaf Clover: Huh? Is it popular to request songs with 520-yuan gifts now? I feel bad spending even fifty-two yuan on a request.]","[One Punch Will Crush You: You didn’t get it, did you? Sis is teaching certain people how things are done!]","At that moment, the clear, soothing voice she had been longing to hear finally rang out, breaking the awkward silence with a hint of helpless amusement.","“Ahem, that’s enough. Thank you, Sis.”","Xu paused, seemingly organizing his thoughts.","“So, I’m more familiar with sad love songs, while Qing is new here, but he’s pretty good at singing pop songs.”","His voice was unhurried and steady, instantly guiding the atmosphere in the room back onto the right track.","Then he turned to the newcomer who was still stammering and said, “Qing, send your song list to... Food... Liu You Sis.”","When he said “Food Liu You,” Xu ultimately couldn’t hold back. A very soft laugh escaped through the microphone.","It was faint, but Gu Lan still heard it.","She immediately pounced on him in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: I heard that! You’re laughing at my name! (sobbing).jpg]","[Food Liu You: That’s too much! You’re being punished with one extra song!]","The fans in the public chat joined in the teasing.","[Squid Strips: Hahaha, that’s right! How could you laugh at our big sis, Brother Xu?!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: Punish him! He absolutely has to sing!]","Xu let out a low laugh. The sound traveled through the current and slipped into Gu Lan’s ears, making her toes curl.","“My fault, my fault. I couldn’t help myself.” His voice was full of laughter. “Then... thank you, Miss Liu You?”","Gu Lan continued typing.","[Food Liu You: Listen to yourself. “Liu You”—does that sound nice to you? Can a girl really be called that?]","Xu readily went along with her. “Then... thank you, Lazy Lamb?”","Gu Lan’s avatar was an abstract-looking Lazy Lamb, so he had clearly noticed it.","That nickname...","Somehow, it sounded even cuter.","Gu Lan’s heart filled with delight. She was just about to reply when the host named Ears suddenly cut in, speaking at lightning speed.","“Hey! Sis, sis! We have a rule in our room— for 300 yuan, you can reserve a private claim! Want to reserve one?”","A private claim?","Gu Lan genuinely had no idea what that slang meant.","【Food Liu You: Private claim? What’s that?】","Ears immediately explained, “Once you reserve a private claim, no one in our room besides Xu and Qing, whom you requested, is allowed to proactively ‘assign you homework’ or send you private messages for no reason! Anyone caught doing it gets fined!”","“Assigning homework” was their slang for privately messaging someone to poach them.","The moment Ears said that, his intentions became glaringly obvious.","He was doing this to guard against Muzhi.","After all, Strawberry Cheesecake had originally come to listen to Xu as well. But because she hadn’t reserved a private claim, Muzhi had coaxed her away with a few private messages.","It was a cautionary tale.","With this move, Ears had dragged Muzhi’s little scheme straight into the open, making it impossible for him to use the same trick again.","Gu Lan understood instantly.","Oh? So that was how this worked?","Interesting.","Instead of answering directly, she deliberately tagged Xu in the public chat.","【Food Liu You: @Wn.Xu I don’t understand. Should I reserve one?】","She ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌‍tossed the ball to Xu.","The moment she asked, Xu’s fans in the public chat became more anxious than anyone else.","【Squid Strips: @Food Liu You Sis, reserve one, reserve one! Please!】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Reserve it, reserve it, reserve it! We all did! Once you reserve one, we’ll be family!】","They were terrified that this goddess-like big sis who had appeared out of nowhere would be lured away by that greasy guy from next door.","There was silence on the mic for a few seconds.","Everyone’s attention focused on Xu.","Then he let out a soft laugh, and a hint of seriousness entered his clear, warm voice.","“Of course I hope you will.”","His answer was direct and frank.","Gu Lan was very pleased.","She liked people who didn’t beat around the bush.","【Food Liu You: Okay then, I’ll reserve one.】","She sent another message.","【Food Liu You: You guys can choose the songs yourselves. I’ll listen to whatever you’re best at.】"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Off-key Practice More~","paragraphs":["The voice chat fell silent for a moment.","A few seconds later, the newcomer named Qing turned on his mic, his voice carrying a faint, nervous static.","“Th-then... I’ll go first.”","Qing sounded a little flustered, and it was obvious how embarrassed he felt.","“Otherwise, if I wait until Brother Xu finishes singing, I won’t dare open my mouth.”","His half-joking confession sent a string of “Hahahaha” and “Go for it, Qing!” across the chat.","Gu Lan found it rather amusing too.","This newcomer had a pretty good grasp of his own abilities.","Soon, the accompaniment started. It was a gentle pop love song.","Qing actually had a decent voice—a clean, youthful tone. His technique was still very raw, though, and his breathing was unsteady. He sounded like an ordinary guy who happened to sing pretty well at karaoke, with all the youthful awkwardness of an unpolished voice.","Gu Lan rested her chin in her hand as she listened, thinking to herself:","This kid is kind of adorable.","Like a fluffy, harmless little puppy, the sort that made you want to tease him.","An idea struck her. She opened the gift list.","Her finger scrolled through it before stopping on a gift called Phoenixes Soaring Together.","131,400 diamonds.","Thirteen hundred and fourteen yuan.","The number was a homophone for “a lifetime together.”","Sending it to a streamer she had known for less than an hour—one who even sang off-key—could only be described as... completely insane.","But ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‍Gu Lan liked doing things like that.","Without the slightest hesitation, she tapped Send.","“...My love for you will last forever...”","On the mic, Qing had just reached the chorus when, without warning, a pair of magnificent phoenixes erupted across the screen.","Golden light and fluttering feathers instantly took over the entire display. The animation was long and spectacular, almost completely covering everyone’s usernames.","[Food Liu You sent Wn. Qing Phoenixes Soaring Together x1 (131,400 diamonds)]","Right at the moment the phoenixes reached their highest point, Qing’s singing suddenly took a spectacular detour—and flew straight to Siberia.","The melody vanished.","He stammered and tried to pull the song back on track, but his breathing was completely thrown off. In the end, all he could manage was a series of helpless hums.","The song ended in a catastrophic vocal pileup.","The entire voice room fell deathly silent.","Then the public chat exploded.","[Wn. Ears: !! My goodness! Phoenixes Soaring Together! Thank you, Big Sister Food Liu You, for sending Qing a Phoenixes Soaring Together! What an incredibly generous boss! May you always be healthy and have everything go your way!]","[Wn. Volcano: Thank you, sis! You’re amazing!]","[Wn. Yechen: Thank you, sis, for supporting Qing...]","[Squid Strips: ??? 1,314 yuan??? You just sent that without hesitation???]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: I’m speechless. That’s my entire monthly living allowance...]","[The Little Boy Who Sells Bombs: Sis! I can sing this song too! And I won’t go off-key! Look at me!]","[Room Moderator—Little Star: Don’t call her “sis,” you shameless lot! Muted!]","Amid the chaos, Gu Lan leisurely typed a message.","[Food Liu You: You went off-key! Practice more from now on.]","She added a pat-on-the-head sticker, making the message seem both generous and faintly indulgent, like a doting elder who was exasperated with a hopeless child.","Qing’s mic remained on, and his heavy breathing could be heard. He was clearly scared out of his wits.","After a long while, he finally managed to squeeze out, “Th-thank you, big sister... I-I’ll definitely practice hard...”","His voice trembled like a leaf.","Gu Lan was amused by his reaction. She was just about to tease him a little more when a thought suddenly occurred to her.","“San-chan, I’m a little curious. What do the streamers’ private group chats look like right now?”","[Ding! Easy peasy! San-chan, the God of the Internet, is now broadcasting it live for you!]","The next second, a screenshot of a WeChat group chat appeared directly in Gu Lan’s mind.","[Goodnight Melody Lineup Group]","[Wn. Volcano: Aaaaaah! Phoenixes Soaring Together! A living rich lady is here! Aaaaaah!]","[Wn. Volcano: @Wn. Qing, what kind of dog luck did you have?! I can understand Brother Xu’s situation—after all, she’s been keeping the public chat alive for so long. But what about you? You didn’t even say a word, and she threw 1,314 at your face?!]","[Wn. Yechen: ...I’m jealous.]","[Wn. Xu: That’s what you get for not doing your “homework” properly.]","[Wn. Chuan: ...I send messages to the number-one and number-two fans every day, and not one of them has ever replied to me. (Jealousy has twisted my face beyond recognition.jpg)]","[Wn. Muzhi: ...]","Muzhi had sent only six dots, but even through the screen, Gu Lan could sense the sourness and resentment practically spilling out of them.","That felt good.","Gu Lan shut down the livestream in her mind, thoroughly satisfied.","Just then, Xu cleared his throat on the public mic, and that clear, mellow voice finally rang out again.","“All right, Qing, go take a breather and have some water.”","He first soothed the shaken newcomer before speaking again at an unhurried pace.","“It’s my turn now, right? Thanks, Lazy Lamb.”","He sang the kind of heartbroken love song he was best at.","His technique was polished, and his emotions were on point. Unlike Muzhi, he didn’t have that deliberate, greasy affectation. But what truly made his performance lethal was his vocal tone.","That cool, crystalline voice with just a hint of roughness, singing lyrics about loving someone he could never have—it was nothing short of devastating.","As Gu Lan listened, she opened the gift box once again.","The joy of spending money only came once? How could that possibly be enough?","She scrolled through the gift list and soon discovered a new feature.","[Compatibility Blind Box.]","The sender could set up two boxes, each containing different-value gifts, and ask the streamer to blindly choose one.","If the streamer guessed correctly, the grand prize was yours.","If they guessed wrong, the grand prize disappeared.","It was a game that tested both rapport and luck.","Gu Lan looked at the feature description and gave a mischievous smile.","A test of luck?","Not for her. In her case, it only tested her financial resources.","She opened the blind-box setup.","In the box on the left, she selected the gift [Heart-Shaped Airplane], quantity: 30.","In the box on the right, she selected the exact same gift, also in a quantity of 30.","A single Heart-Shaped Airplane cost 18,800 diamonds, or 188 yuan. Thirty of them came to 5,640 yuan.","The two boxes together contained more than ten thousand yuan worth of gifts.","No matter which box Xu chose, the result would be exactly the same.","Once everything was set up, she tapped Send.","Xu’s song happened to be reaching its end. The final note drifted gently into silence, leaving behind a long, lingering aftertaste.","He was just about to say a few words of thanks when a huge blind box marked with a question mark slowly appeared in the center of the public chat.","[Food Liu You has issued you a Compatibility Blind Box challenge. Please choose the box on the left or the box on the right!]","Xu was visibly stunned.","“Hm? A blind box?” He let out a light laugh. “Lamb, are you testing me?”","The public chat instantly grew lively again.","[Squid Strips: Aaaaaah, it’s a Compatibility Blind Box! Brother Xu, don’t get it wrong!]","[Salted Pomelo Pear: I’m guessing! I’m guessing Big Sister Lamb put one Heart-Shaped Airplane in each box!]","[One Punch Will Crush You: Think bigger! I’m guessing ten airplanes!]","Xu looked at the chat and asked with a smile, “Which one should I choose? Lamb, give me a hint.”","Gu Lan typed leisurely.","[Food Liu You: I feel like either one is fine. (ͼ̤͂͜ͽ̤͂)✧]","The moment those words were spoken, a whole row of question marks instantly swept across the public chat.","What did she mean, “Either side is fine”?","【Squid Strips: ??? Big Sister, what do you mean by that? Could it be...】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Could it be that both sides are the same?!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: Is this what favoritism looks like? I’m jealous!】","【Wn. Volcano: @One Punch Will Crush You I want some too! I want to be favored!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: I’ll give you a one-yuan kiss. Take it or leave it.】","Xu also caught the unusual implication in her words. After pondering for a moment, he let out a soft laugh and said, “All right. I’ll listen to you and just pick one at random.”","He casually tapped the box on the left.","The next second, the sound of a dense, continuous roar of airplane engines came through everyone’s headphones!","The screen was instantly flooded with messages.","One heart-shaped airplane effect after another shot up from the bottom of the screen with long blazing trails behind them—thirty in total, one after another without pause, resembling a spectacular meteor shower.","Because the gift was worth so much, it directly triggered a server-wide scrolling banner announcement.","【Player “Food Liu You” sent streamer “Wn. Xu” 30 Heart Planes in the room [Goodnight Melody]! Come watch!】","At that moment, every user online across the entire Oxygen app saw the gleaming golden banner.","The [Goodnight Melody] room completely lost its mind.","【Wn. Ears: ...I-I-I-I... I’m bad at math. Can someone tell me how much thirty planes cost?!】","【Little Wimp: Five thousand six hundred! It’s 5,640 yuan!!!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: No way... Does anyone play a chemistry blind box like this?! Thirty planes all at once?! I usually agonize for half an hour over whether to pick left or right before sending a three-yuan bar of soap!】","【Wn. Qing: Jealous! So jealous!】","【Squid Strips: Aaaaaah! So both sides had thirty planes?! Big Sister, just how rich are you?!】","Even Strawberry Cheesecake, who had just been overshadowed by Gu Lan, couldn’t help popping into the chat.","【Strawberry Cheesecake: I thought Brother Xu was going to get another dud, hahaha. Big Sister Lamb is so generous.】","Amid the deafening waves of astonishment and thanks, Salted Pomelo Pear sent a message that summed up everyone’s feelings.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: @Food Liu You The name “Food Liu You”—“rich enough to make oil flow”—really suits you perfectly, Big Sister Lamb.】"]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Military training is exhausting me to death. Did you miss me","paragraphs":["Rich Enough to Drip Money?","Yeah, that name really did suit her current situation.","She curled her lips into a smile and was just about to chat with her adorable fans in the public chat, showing off her “perfectly ordinary” ability to throw money around.","“Knock, knock-knock!”","Someone knocked on the bedroom door. A moment later, her mother’s familiar, booming voice came from outside, urging her on in a frantic rush.","“Gu Lan! What’s taking you so long? If we don’t leave now, you’ll be late for registration!”","Registration?","The smile on Gu Lan’s face froze.","What registration?","Her brain crashed for three seconds before a term she had completely banished to the far corners of her mind came crashing back—","College registration!","Oh no! She’d forgotten!","Her gaze moved away from the golden airplane effects and the flood of comments saying “Big sis is awesome!” on her phone screen. Gu Lan suddenly felt the world spinning around her.","On one side was a wealthy big sister who spent money like water and was adored by thousands.","On the other was a miserable freshman who might be late on the very first day of college and get called out by her counselor.","The gap between the two identities...","Was way too huge.","She scrambled up from the bed. Without even looking at the rapidly scrolling comments—“Big sis, look at me!” and “Rich big sister!”—she hurriedly typed a line into the chat box.","[Food Liu You: Something came up. I have to go.]","Send.","Then she snapped her laptop shut with a sharp click. Her movements were crisp and decisive, as if she hadn’t just closed an app, but an entire virtual world of luxury and excess.","“I’m coming, I’m coming!” she called as she dragged her suitcase out from under the bed and dashed out of the bedroom.","...","One week later.","A University, Girls’ Dormitory Room 303.","Gu Lan lay sprawled on her upper bunk like a dried-out salted fish, all four limbs splayed out. She didn’t even have the strength to move a finger.","The week-long hellish military training had finally ended.","She felt as though every last bit of her had been hollowed out, leaving behind only a sweat-soaked, sun-blackened shell.","Her roommates were in much the same condition.","“I hereby announce that my legs no longer belong to me,” Zhu Jiaying declared. She was a hot-tempered girl from Sichuan, and at that moment she was moaning as she rubbed soothing cream onto her calves.","“Jiaying, keep it down. I feel like my ears are buzzing,” Liu Anyao said weakly from the opposite bed, pushing up her glasses.","In ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‍the corner, Wu Luyi had gone a step further and put on a steam eye mask. She murmured, “Let me die. Let me die in the paradise of the second dimension...”","Gu Lan kept her eyes closed. There was only one thought in her mind.","So tired.","She was tired right down to her bones.","But amid that fog of exhaustion, a clear yet slightly lazy voice suddenly surfaced without warning.","“...Thank you, Lazy Lamb.”","“Then... thank you, Miss Foodflow?”","The man gave a low chuckle, his voice indulgent and doting.","Gu Lan jolted and opened her eyes.","That’s right! Xu!","She hadn’t logged into the Oxygen app for almost a week!","A strange sense of urgency surged through her. Forgetting all about her aching body, she struggled to grab the phone beside her pillow.","She unlocked it, found the orange-and-white app icon, and tapped it.","In an instant, countless notification messages flooded the top of the screen.","Gu Lan had no interest in checking the room announcements and system messages cluttering up the screen. She went straight to her private messages.","Two chat windows sat quietly at the very top, each marked with a red unread notification.","[Wn.Xu]","[Wn.Qing]","Without the slightest hesitation, she tapped Xu’s avatar.","The chat history still stopped at the day she had logged off.","After she sent, “Something came up. I have to go,” Xu had replied almost instantly.","[Wn.Xu: Mm. Go take care of things.]","[Wn.Xu: Be careful on the way.]","A few minutes later, another message had appeared.","[Wn.Xu: Are you still busy?]","Gu Lan stared at the message, and her heart inexplicably skipped a beat.","Further down were messages from the second day, the third day...","Every day, he had sent her a simple greeting.","[Wn.Xu: Busy today?]","[Wn.Xu: Still not done? Have you forgotten about me?]","[Wn.Xu: (Pouty).jpg]","The last message had been sent three days ago. Looking at that reaction image, Gu Lan couldn’t help laughing.","She could practically imagine the man sitting in front of his microphone, opening their chat again and again, only to be disappointed each time.","Kind of cute.","At the same time, messages were rapidly scrolling through a WeChat group chat made up entirely of streamers.","[Goodnight Melody Lineup Group]","[Wn.Yechen: @Wn.Brother Xu, that new big sister of yours... Could her rich-lady experience card really have expired? She hasn’t logged on for a whole week.]","[Wn.Muzhi: Maybe she’s just a student who saved up some pocket money and came on to experience the lifestyle. That’s normal.]","[Wn.Muzhi: It’s just that... the room battle is tomorrow, and Brother Xu, your target is still the one set back when Cheesecake Sis was around, right? A revenue target of 180,000 is pretty high. Why don’t you talk to Boss Garlic Paste and ask him to lower it?]","His words sounded like concern, but every single one of them stabbed at Xu’s heart.","[Wn.Ears: There’s no need for you to pretend to care! We’ll figure out Brother Xu’s target ourselves!]","A new message suddenly appeared. It was from one of the room’s financial backers.","[Boss-Garlic Paste: @Wn.Xu Where are you? Has that Food Liu You replied to your private messages?]","The group fell silent for several seconds.","[Wn.Xu: No.]","[Boss-Garlic Paste: No? The room battle is tomorrow, and your target is the highest in the entire room. Don’t you know that? If you can’t complete it, you can forget about being the room manager. According to the rules, you’ll have to cover the penalty yourself. I told you to put more effort into maintaining your clients. Are you finally panicking now?]","Garlic Paste’s words were blunt, carrying the force and pressure of someone in charge.","[Wn.Ears: Boss, Big Sister Lamb might really have something going on. Squid Strips and Salt Juice also said they’ve been busy with military training since starting college. None of them have had time to log on for a week.]","[Boss-Garlic Paste: I don’t care what she has going on. The rules are the rules. @Wn.Xu You figure it out yourself.]","The group fell silent once again.","No one dared to say anything else.","And Gu Lan, far away in her college dormitory, knew nothing about any of it.","She was happily tapping away at her phone, her fingers flying across the keyboard.","[Food Liu You: I’m back!!!]","[Food Liu You: I’ve been doing military training lately! It practically killed me!]","The moment she sent the messages, the words “The other person is typing...” appeared at the top of the chat window.","Gu Lan’s heart rose and fell along with those few words.","He replied so fast!","[Wn.Xu: Military training? You’re a freshman?]","Looking at the reply, Gu Lan’s smile spread wider and wider.","She deliberately didn’t answer right away, mischievously leaving him hanging for a few seconds before slowly typing.","[Food Liu You: Yes~ Yes~]","[Food Liu You: It’s been a whole week since we saw each other. Did you miss me? (Kitten peeking out).jpg]","[Food Liu You: You were the first person I looked for as soon as I got my phone back~]","After sending the messages, she tossed her phone onto the pillow, covered her face with both hands, and rolled around on the bed twice.","Her phone buzzed. She immediately snatched it back up.","On the screen, “Typing...” appeared, then disappeared; disappeared, then appeared again.","Back and forth several times.","What was he hesitating over?","Gu Lan’s curiosity was thoroughly piqued.","Finally, a new message popped up.","Just one word and an emoji.","【Wn.Xu: Want. (blushing).jpg】","!!!","Gu Lan felt as if a kitten’s paw had lightly scratched at her heart, leaving it tingling and itchy.","【Food Liu You: Why aren’t you in the room? I want to hear your voice.】"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: You Call Me 'Sister'~","paragraphs":["On the other end of the phone, the reply came almost instantly.","【Wn.Xu: Today’s hall battle. I’ve already been put on the schedule.】","Gu Lan blinked.","Hall battle?","She had heard the term before. It was an activity held between guilds on certain voice-chat apps to compete for resources and rankings.","Sometimes, two guilds would go head-to-head, with the winner being whoever received more gifts.","Other times, a guild would assign its streamers targets, with penalties for anyone who failed to meet them.","【Food Liu You: A hall battle? Are you guys competing against another hall?】","【Wn.Xu: No PK. Our hall just sets a target.】","Gu Lan understood.","So it was the second kind.","Her fingers moved, and she sent over another question.","【Food Liu You: So, did you complete your target?】","But after she sent the message, the other side went silent.","The “typing...” indicator lit up, then disappeared, only to light up again.","Gu Lan could practically imagine the helpless look on the man’s face as the question left him speechless.","After quite a while, a single line finally drifted over.","【Wn.Xu: ?】","【Wn.Xu: Why would you ask such a hurtful question?】","Gu Lan burst out laughing. Hugging her pillow, she rolled across the bed.","So cute. Way too cute.","She cleared her throat, fighting back her laughter as her fingers flew across the keyboard, her teasing taking on a distinctly mischievous edge.","【Food Liu You: Call me Big Sis.】","【Food Liu You: I’ll help you complete your target.】","This time, the “typing...” indicator on the other end vanished completely, replaced by a long silence.","Gu Lan wasn’t in a hurry. She simply propped up her chin and waited.","She knew he would reply.","Sure enough, a minute later, a new message popped up.","【Wn.Xu: You’re younger than me...】","Gu Lan’s wicked streak immediately surfaced.","【Food Liu You: Doesn’t matter. I want to hear it.】","【Food Liu You: Call me Big Sis!】","Bossy and completely unreasonable.","Even ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​‍Gu Lan found herself amused.","This time, the silence lasted even longer.","Just as Gu Lan began to wonder whether she had scared him off, a green voice-message bar suddenly appeared in the chat window.","1 second.","Only one second.","Gu Lan’s heartbeat skipped.","She instinctively sat up straight. She even smoothed down her messy hair from military training before carefully bringing the phone to her ear and pressing play.","A soft male voice slipped against her ear. It carried a hint of helplessness, mixed with an indescribable indulgence and fondness.","“Big Sis~”","The final note lifted slightly and lingered, like a feather lightly, yet unmistakably, teasing the very tip of her heart.","It was both deeply attractive and utterly intoxicating.","Boom!","Gu Lan felt the tips of her ears, along with half her cheeks, suddenly catch fire.","Oh, no.","Who could possibly withstand this?","Before she could recover from the devastating impact of that single “Big Sis,” her phone vibrated again. A new text message appeared right after the voice note.","【Wn.Xu: It’s fine. I’ve already paid the penalty.】","【Wn.Xu: Save it for next time.】","He had already paid the penalty?","Gu Lan froze for a moment, then understood.","He had failed to meet the target and paid the penalty out of his own pocket.","No.","How could she let him miss out on making money?","【Food Liu You: No, no. I’m helping you complete it today.】","【Food Liu You: Come on! Let’s go to the hall! (angry).jpg】","【Wn.Xu: ...】","【Wn.Xu: All right. I’ll go request a mic slot.】","...","Xu moved quickly.","Gu Lan had only just entered the voice hall 【Goodnight Melody】 when she saw that Xu’s profile picture had already appeared at the end of the mic queue.","At that moment, the people on mic were chatting animatedly.","It was that fence-sitter, Yechen.","“...Why is Brother Xu coming up? Didn’t he say he wasn’t going to participate today? You already paid the penalty for missing the target?”","The instant he finished speaking, another loud, boisterous voice rang out. It belonged to the mood-maker, Ears.","“Big Sister Lamb! Big Sister Lamb is here! Holy crap! Welcome home, Sister FoodLiuYou!”","With that shout from Ears, the public chat instantly exploded.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Aaaaaaaaaah, Big Sister Lamb! You’re finally back?!】","【Squid Strips: Sis! I missed you so much!】","【Little Wimp: Welcome home, Big Sister!】","Looking at the screen filled with welcomes, Gu Lan’s mood brightened. She was just about to type a reply when her attention was caught by a gleaming number in the mic queue.","Beneath Muzhi’s profile picture was a line of gift points that kept ticking upward.","【Box Score: 3,345,600】","Three million points.","At Oxygen’s exchange rate, that amounted to over thirty thousand yuan.","He had received more than thirty thousand in a single day?","Gu Lan raised her brows, a little surprised.","On mic, Yechen continued fawning over him. The envy and jealousy in his voice practically spilled through the screen.","“Brother Muzhi is incredible! He received an Eternal Black Gold for today’s hall battle! Oh my god, an Eternal Black Gold! I’ve dreamed of receiving one. Looks like I’ll never have a chance in this lifetime...”","Eternal Black Gold?","Gu Lan thought she had seen that name in the gift list before, but she hadn’t paid much attention to it.","She casually typed a line in the public chat.","【Food Liu You: Eternal Black Gold?】","The moment she appeared, someone immediately responded.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Big Sister, Eternal Black Gold is the most expensive gift on the platform. The special effects are incredible! One costs 2,888,888 diamonds!】","Two million eight hundred eighty-eight thousand diamonds.","Converted, that was 28,888.88 yuan.","One gift cost nearly thirty thousand yuan.","【Strawberry Cheesecake: It’s expensive, sure, but it’s also genuinely ugly. It’s so gaudy and golden—it screams nouveau riche. If Muzhi hadn’t insisted on using it to climb the rankings, I really would’ve sent something with better effects.】","Reading their messages, Gu Lan understood.","It was the most expensive gift, but it was ugly.","Muzhi had wanted his top supporter to send it specifically so he could climb the rankings.","A brilliant idea suddenly popped into her head.","【Food Liu You: I’ve never seen it before. You’ve all made it sound so impressive.】","【Food Liu You: I’ll send one and take a look.】","The public chat fell silent for a moment.","Then, several hesitant comments floated up.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: ...Big Sister, that one’s really expensive...】","【Squid Strips: Yeah, Big Sister, you don’t have to spend so much. Just listen to the songs!】","They all thought Gu Lan was joking, or that she didn’t know how much it cost.","Even Yechen, up on mic, let out two awkward laughs.","“Haha, Big Sister Lamb is such a joker. That gift really is... well, not something ordinary people can afford.”","Gu Lan ignored them.","Her finger had already tapped on Xu’s profile picture.","A gift-sending window popped up on the screen.","She swiped through the dazzling array of gifts and quickly found the name she was looking for—【Eternal Black Gold】.","Just as Strawberry Cheesecake had said, the icon was indeed golden and gaudy, radiating the unmistakable air of a nouveau riche tycoon. The design had absolutely no sense of beauty.","But beneath the icon was a small set of quick-send options.","【x1】, 【x10】, 【x38】.","Gu Lan’s fingertip lightly tapped the screen, landing precisely on the 【x10】 option.","A payment confirmation dialog immediately appeared in the center of the screen.","【You are about to send 10 Eternal Black Gold gifts to streamer “Wn.Xu,” for a total of 28,888,880 diamonds. Confirm?】","More than twenty-eight million diamonds.","Nearly 300,000 yuan.","Gu Lan didn’t even blink.","Confirm. Send.","Her finger pressed down lightly."]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Ten black golds, is that enough","paragraphs":["In that instant, the entire voice room seemed to have been muted.","Time froze for 0.01 seconds.","Then—","BOOM——!!!","The screen exploded.","This wasn’t the gorgeous, dreamy special effect of Phoenix in Flight from earlier. This was a nearly brutal, utterly unreasonable visual assault.","Ten enormous, glittering, golden [Eternal Black Gold] gift effects came charging up from the bottom of the screen one after another, each more aggressively than the last.","The rich, tacky gold light was practically blinding everyone.","The animation was long and overbearing, smearing the entire public chat into a golden mosaic. Even the avatars of everyone on the mics were completely covered.","Before anyone could recover from the sea of gold, an even more dazzling and brazen banner swept across the top of the entire Oxygen app, visible to every user.","[Supreme Announcement: Player “Food Liu You” has sent streamer “Wn.Xu” 10 Eternal Black Gold gifts in the room [Goodnight Melody]! A miracle has descended—come witness it!]","The golden words, accompanied by a scrolling effect, passed by once, twice, three times...","Every user online throughout the app—whether they were in a music room, a social room, or even a game room—saw this epic full-server announcement at that very moment.","This tiny voice room, [Goodnight Melody], was instantly flooded with countless passersby who had come running after hearing the news.","The room’s online numbers shot from a few hundred to several thousand in an instant, and continued rising at a terrifying speed.","The public chat completely went insane.","[Holy crap!? Am I seeing things? Ten Black Golds?!]","[Which tycoon is that? Food Liu You? Never heard of them. A newcomer?]","[No way... Are room battles this insane now? Spending three hundred thousand on an internal task for a small guild? Is that even reasonable?]","[I just checked her profile. This Food Liu You account was created recently! A total newbie!]","[She just registered and immediately threw down three hundred thousand? Are rich women this wild nowadays? I wonder how she compares to Sister Yaya.]","[Heh, she just got carried away. You really think anyone can compare with our Sister Yaya? Sister Yaya has spent over ten million on Oxygen. Someone who’s just here to experience life will get bored after a few days.]","[Don’t start a fight! They’re all generous big sisters! As long as Big Sister is happy! Big Sister is awesome!]","Meanwhile, inside [Goodnight Melody], the eight streamers on the mics, along with every moderator and fan in the room, had all turned to stone.","Complete silence.","You could hear a pin drop.","Even Ears, the atmosphere-maker who had been frantically stirring up the crowd moments ago, had fallen silent. His microphone was pitch-black, without a sound.","Their brains had been completely smashed into shutdown mode by those ten Black Gold gifts.","One cost nearly thirty thousand.","Ten cost nearly three hundred thousand.","Three hundred thousand yuan, all for a streamer’s unfinished task—one with a penalty of only a few thousand yuan?","What kind of concept was that?","This wasn’t merely being rich anymore. This was pathological!","Xu sat in front of his computer, watching the golden afterglow on the screen slowly fade. In his headphones came the roar of the gift effects and the crazed barrage of messages from the newcomers.","He had thought Gu Lan would send one.","After all, she had asked him, and he knew she wasn’t short of money.","Sending one would save his pride while also showing off her financial power.","But he had never imagined that she would send ten.","And in such an absurd manner.","Three hundred thousand yuan.","For an online streamer she had known for less than a week and had never even met in person.","Just who was this girl?","While the entire voice room was trapped in a strange silence, an incomparably pleasant notification rang out in Gu Lan’s mind.","[Ding! The host has spent 288,888.8 yuan on a target with a facial attractiveness score of 90, triggering a tenfold cashback! A cashback amount of 2,888,888 yuan has been credited. Please check your account!]","That felt good.","Gu Lan stretched contentedly. Looking at the long string of numbers in the bank notification on her phone, the smile on her face deepened.","Making money really was wonderful.","At last, Ears’s loud and boisterous voice was the first to return, trembling with excitement and breaking several times.","“I-I-I-I... I hereby announce! From today onward, Big Sister Lamb is my one and only big sister! Sorry, Brother Xu! You’re going to have to take a back seat!”","Right afterward, the newcomer Qing also typed a message in the public chat, followed by more than a dozen kneeling emojis.","[Wn.Qing: I’d never seen a Black Gold before. I thought I’d go my whole life without seeing one. But today... I’ve seen so many I’m getting sick of them.]","Volcano also opened his mic and shouted in a half-joking, half-serious tone, “Where are my fans!? See that!? That’s someone else’s big sister! I want Black Gold too! Did you hear me? Send me Black Gold!”","His fans immediately responded in the public chat.","[Little Wimp: ??? Are you still dreaming?]","[One Punch Will Crush You: Volcano, close your eyes right now. Hurry. I’ll send you a hundred in your dreams.]","Amid the chaos, Gu Lan’s gaze swept over the mic order and landed on the avatar at the very bottom—right beneath the newcomer Qing.","The gift-value box below his avatar contained a pitifully low score. Converted into yuan, it probably wasn’t even worth a hundred.","The poor kid was rather pitiful.","With a thought, she opened the gift list again.","Before anyone else could react, another [Eternal Black Gold] effect burst into the air.","This time, however, the recipient was the newcomer at the end of the mic order—","Wn.Qing.","If the ten Black Golds earlier had been an atomic bomb that left everyone stunned, then this one was a sugar-coated artillery shell casually tossed out for fun, blasting the recipient, Qing, completely senseless.","He ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​‍even forgot to speak when he got on the mic and could only type frantically in the public chat.","[Wn.Qing: !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Big Sister!!!! Thank you, Big Sister! I’m bowing to you—bang bang bang! I can’t speak anymore! Aaaaaah!]","This time, even the fans of the other streamers couldn’t stay calm.","Even Muzhi’s big sister, Strawberry Cheesecake, couldn’t help popping up.","[Strawberry Cheesecake: ...Does Big Sister Lamb need another little sister? I can do the “nyaa nyaa” thing.]","Gu Lan was laughing so hard at the barrage of flattery that she was about to chat with them a little longer when a private-message notification suddenly appeared at the top of her phone screen.","It was Xu.","She opened it.","[Wn.Xu: Want to hear a song?]","Looking at those four simple words, Gu Lan began wondering what expression the person on the other side of the screen was wearing.","She had just started typing to request a song when Wu Luyi, who had been lying motionless in the dorm room with a steam eye mask on, suddenly sat bolt upright as if revived from the brink of death.","“Girls! Major news!”","Her shout brought the other two girls, who had also been lying motionless, back to life.","Rubbing her calf, Zhu Jiaying asked irritably, “What is it? Did one of your paper-thin fictional characters come back to life?”","“Even more explosive than that!” Wu Luyi held up her phone, her face glowing with excitement. “You know Chen Sisi from the dorm across from ours, right? The rich heiress covered head to toe in designer brands! We went to high school together. She said she wants to treat our whole dorm to the hottest male-model club in town for a little eye-opening experience! She’s asking if we want to go and make up the numbers!”","“A male-model club?!” Zhu Jiaying’s eyes lit up instantly. Her calf stopped hurting, and the ringing in her ears disappeared too. “Seriously?!”","“Of course it’s serious! Chen Sisi just asked me in the hallway!”","“I’m in! We absolutely have to go!” Zhu Jiaying slapped the bed frame. “I’ve lived this long and never seen a real male model!”","Liu Anyáo pushed up her glasses and asked quietly, “...Will it be expensive?”","“Chen Sisi is paying! What’s there to worry about?” Wu Luyi was practically buzzing with excitement. “So? Are you going or not?”","“Yes!”","“Of course!”","Three pairs of eyes turned in unison toward Gu Lan, who was still lying on the top bunk.","Gu Lan: “...”","Male models?","Her mind instantly filled with images of handsome men with chiseled abs.","She had to go! Absolutely had to!","She immediately grabbed her phone. Forget singing—she quickly typed into the chat box.","【Food Liu You: No more singing, no more singing! My roommates are calling me out to go shopping! I’ll find you tomorrow!】","The other person replied almost instantly.","【Wn.Xu: This late?】","【Wn.Xu: Be careful.】","【Wn.Xu: See you tomorrow.】","Gu Lan looked at his concerned reminders, her heart turning sweet, but she couldn’t help feeling that something was missing.","Her eyes shifted, and she gave a mischievous smile.","【Food Liu You: Did you forget something?】","The other side was silent for a few seconds.","【Wn.Xu: Huh?】","【Wn.Xu: Good night?】","Seeing how adorably confused he was, the curve of Gu Lan’s lips grew wider and wider.","【Food Liu You: Why didn’t you call me Big Sis?】","This time, the “typing...” indicator lingered for a long while.","Just when Gu Lan began to wonder whether he was too shy to say it, a new message finally popped up.","【Wn.Xu: Big Sis......】","Two words, followed by a blushing sticker.","Gu Lan’s heart fluttered as if a feather had gently brushed across it—tingly and itchy all at once.","She happily typed out another message.","【Food Liu You: Good boy. I’ll come find you tomorrow.】"]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Can he do it","paragraphs":["Gu Lan tossed her phone beside her pillow, then sat bolt upright on the top bunk in one swift motion.","The movement was so crisp and sudden that it startled the three roommates excitedly chatting on the bunk below.","“Holy crap, Lanlan! Are you back from the dead?” Zhu Jiaying patted her chest.","Gu Lan had already jumped down from the bed and was pulling open the wardrobe.","Male models?","Now that was a new one.","She had been alive for eighteen years, and aside from seeing them on TV and on her phone, she had never encountered a real-life male model before.","A row of clothes hung inside the wardrobe. A few were designer pieces her mother had insisted on stuffing into her suitcase, but they were all rather ladylike in style. Gu Lan had never worn any of them.","Her fingers slid along the hangers before finally stopping at the simplest-looking dress: a sky-blue spaghetti-strap dress.","For a place like that, dressing too formally would make it seem as though she cared too much, which would put her at a disadvantage.","Better to keep it simple and casual. The whole point was to experience life.","“Hurry up, you guys. Don’t keep the girls across the hall waiting,” Gu Lan urged as she changed.","“Coming, coming!”","“Where’s my lipstick? Has anyone seen my lipstick?”","“Yao Yao, don’t be so nervous. Your face has gone white—you look like we’re going to a graveyard.”","The dorm room dissolved into chaos.","Ten ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌‍minutes later, the four of them were finally ready. They met up with Chen Sisi and her group in the hallway.","As expected, Chen Sisi was the center of attention.","She wore a black, figure-hugging miniskirt with a glittering jacket over it. Her makeup was immaculate, her red lips striking, and the pair of thin high heels on her feet gave her a commanding presence.","By comparison, the four girls from Gu Lan’s dorm looked like a few elementary school students who had wandered into a spider cave by mistake, their youthful innocence making them seem completely out of place.","Chen Sisi didn’t mind at all. She greeted them enthusiastically. “Come on, ladies! Tonight, I’m going to show you what paradise on earth looks like!”","The so-called “paradise on earth” was a club located in a prime area of the city center.","Its name was incredibly tacky: Golden Night.","But once she stepped inside, Gu Lan realized she had underestimated the place.","The first thing she saw was understated luxury. The air was filled with an expensive fragrance, and every server was handsome and well-built, dressed in the same black uniform. When they saw the group enter, they all bowed in unison.","“Welcome, Sister Sisi.”","A man who looked like the floor manager came over, his face arranged into a perfectly measured smile—enthusiastic without being obsequious.","Chen Sisi gave a familiar nod. “The usual. Get us a large private room.”","“Right away. We’ve had one ready for you for ages.”","The eight girls were led into a massive private room. The long leather sofa alone was big enough for all of them to roll around on.","Everyone except Chen Sisi seemed somewhat ill at ease.","Zhu Jiaying was doing all right, relying on her bold personality as she poked and prodded at everything around her. Wu Luyi hugged a cushion and looked around curiously. Liu Anyao, meanwhile, had not moved since sitting down. She kept her back ramrod straight, like a student waiting for the teacher to call on her.","Gu Lan also felt a little uncomfortable.","She leaned back into the sofa and took out her phone. Instinctively, she wanted to open the Oxygen app to see whether Xu was online.","But the moment the thought arose, the door to the private room was pushed open.","The floor manager from earlier walked in, leading a line of men behind him.","There were eight of them in total.","Every one of them was tall and long-legged, with his own distinctive features. They wore identical white shirts and black trousers, with the top two buttons undone. A wave of testosterone swept into the room.","Zhu Jiaying’s breathing hitched for half a second.","The floor manager walked up to Chen Sisi and bowed slightly as he introduced them with a smile. “Sister Sisi, these are some of the new guys at our club. Would you like to pick first?”","Chen Sisi glanced over them and lazily waved her hand.","“There are eight of them, and eight of us. One each.”","The floor manager immediately understood. He shot the male models a meaningful look. “Be smart. Take good care of the ladies!”","At his command, the eight male models charged forward like soldiers hearing the call to battle...","And all surrounded Chen Sisi.","“Sister Sisi, it’s been so long. I’ve missed you.”","“You look gorgeous tonight, Sister Sisi.”","“What would you like to drink, Sister Sisi? I’ll pour it for you.”","Seven or eight handsome men instantly crowded around Chen Sisi, fawning over her and attending to her every need.","The other girls, left standing to one side, wore awkward expressions.","The room fell deathly silent.","Gu Lan: “...”","Am I just part of the background?","She watched the men jostling to get closer to Chen Sisi and felt a wave of speechlessness.","It was obvious to anyone with eyes that Chen Sisi was the one paying for everything tonight.","Then there were the rest of them, dressed like students out shopping. At a glance, it was clear they weren’t people with money to burn.","Seeking advantage and avoiding disadvantage was only human nature.","Still, this was a little too embarrassing.","If she had known things would turn out like this, she would have been better off staying in the dorm and listening to Xu sing.","At least his voice was genuinely beautiful.","The floor manager was looking a little embarrassed too. He clearly hadn’t expected these newcomers to be so clueless. His expression darkened as he snapped, “Why are you all crowding around one person? Can’t you see there are other guests here? Don’t you know any of the rules?”","Only after being scolded did the male models reluctantly spread out.","Chen Sisi remained perfectly composed throughout. She pulled the most striking-looking man from the group and had him sit beside her.","The man really was handsome, with sharp brows, bright eyes, a high nose, and a pair of dimples when he smiled.","Ding! Target detected. Attractiveness: 87. Name: Xu Yang.","The system’s notification in Gu Lan’s head made her scrutinize the man named Xu Yang a little more closely.","Eighty-seven was a very high score.","But compared with Xu’s ninety, he was still a little lacking.","Besides, there was something overly commercial about him. Even his smile was too polished, like a perfect product manufactured on an assembly line.","Chen Sisi kept Xu Yang. Then she pointed at the remaining seven male models and said to Gu Lan and the others, “You can pick whoever you like from the rest.”","The other seven male models stood there with professional smiles on their faces, though there was more than a little reluctance in their eyes.","Zhu Jiaying and the others exchanged glances, none of them willing to speak first.","Gu Lan had even less desire to choose.","The remaining men weren’t exactly ugly, but compared with Xu Yang, they were clearly a cut below.","Her weakness for good-looking men had flared up again.","Just as the awkward standoff was about to become unbearable, a young man in a bartender’s uniform pushed in a service cart and began pouring drinks for them.","He kept his head lowered, moving quietly as he placed the prepared drinks on the coffee table in front of each girl.","When he reached Gu Lan, he bent down to set down her glass, and she caught a brief glimpse of him.","He had a remarkably clean-cut face, with tousled bangs falling over his forehead, fair skin, and long lashes. Since his head was lowered, she couldn’t see his features clearly, but the smooth, elegant line of his jaw alone was enough to make him beautiful.","Ding! Target detected. Attractiveness: 83. Name: Shen Wei.","The score wasn’t particularly high.","But... he was easy on the eyes.","Much more pleasing to look at than those seven “products.”","A thought stirred in Gu Lan’s mind.","She extended a finger, passed over the few male models poised to be chosen, and pointed directly at the bartender who was still pouring drinks.","“Manager.”","Her voice wasn’t loud, but in the quiet private room, every word rang clear.","Everyone’s gaze turned toward her.","Meeting their stares, Gu Lan pointed at the bartender who looked completely out of his depth and asked slowly, “How about him?”","The bartender, Shen Wei, abruptly looked up, his face adorably blank.","“Huh?”","The floor manager was startled too, but quickly recovered, once again plastering on his professional smile. “Of course.”","Shen Wei, however, panicked and hurriedly waved his hands. “I’m not—”","Before he could finish, the floor manager grabbed him and pulled him over to the corner.","Gu Lan couldn’t hear what they were saying. She could only see the floor manager gesturing animatedly at Shen Wei, his lips moving rapidly.","“...He’s just a student... You only have to chat... We’ll pay you by the hour... And if you’re lucky, you might even get a tip...”","Fragments of their conversation drifted over.","Shen Wei stood there with his head bowed, nervously twisting the hem of his clothes between his fingers, as though engaged in an intense internal struggle.","A few seconds later, he seemed to make up his mind and nodded hesitantly.","Then, under everyone’s watchful gaze, he walked step by step over to Gu Lan and sat down beside her.","The sofa was soft, but he only dared to sit on the very edge, his back ramrod straight. His whole body radiated nervousness.","Seeing this, Zhu Jiaying and the others finally broke the awkward silence and each picked one of the remaining male models.","The atmosphere in the private room gradually came alive again."]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: Let Me Touch It","paragraphs":["The moment Gu Lan made her selection, the atmosphere became subtly awkward.","There had originally been one male model for each of the eight women, but now there was one left over.","The professional smile on the face of the model who had been left behind visibly froze for a moment. He stood where he was, unsure whether to move forward or step back. When his gaze accidentally swept over Shen Wei, a trace of barely detectable resentment flickered in his eyes.","Just a bartender carrying trays.","And yet he was the one who’d been left out?","Chen Sisi took in the whole scene. The corners of her red lips lifted as she lazily beckoned to the extra male model.","“What are you standing there for? Don’t leave. Come sit with me.”","The man looked as if he had just received an order of pardon. His smile instantly returned, and he hurried over to sit beside Chen Sisi on the other side.","“Thank you, Sister Sisi,” he said ingratiatingly.","The male models who had just been chosen by Zhu Jiaying and the others all looked at him with undisguised envy.","Everyone knew that if you stayed with Chen Sisi, you wouldn’t be short on tips that night.","Shen Wei still hadn’t quite figured out what was going on.","Watching the other men, he imitated them. He picked up a glass of freshly poured liquor from the coffee table, held it carefully in both hands, and offered it to Gu Lan.","“Y-You should have a drink.”","His hands were very clean, his nails neatly trimmed. Because he was nervous, his fingertips had gone slightly pale.","Gu Lan didn’t take the glass.","Leaning back into the sofa, she regarded him at her leisure.","“I don’t drink.”","Shen Wei let out an “Huh?” His whole body went blank, and the hand holding the glass froze in midair. He had no idea whether he should pull it back or keep holding it out.","Just as he was about to set the glass down, Gu Lan spoke again, slowly and leisurely.","“You drink it.”","Shen Wei: “...”","He looked at Gu Lan, then at the drink in his hand, seemingly trying to determine whether this was some new requirement for entertaining a customer.","At the floor manager’s meaningful look telling him to be quick-witted, he gritted his teeth, tipped his head back, and downed the mixed drink in one go.","The liquor burned its way down his throat with a spicy fruity fragrance. He rarely drank, and the sudden mouthful made him choke. A thin flush quickly spread across his cheeks.","Looking at his innocent, pure expression, Gu Lan suddenly found him rather amusing.","She leaned slightly forward and moved closer, lowering her voice as she asked, “Do you have abs?”","Shen Wei’s brain completely short-circuited. He stared blankly at Gu Lan, the tips of his ears so red they looked ready to drip blood.","That question was way beyond the syllabus.","“I asked you a question,” Gu Lan prompted.","“...Y-Yes.” He stammered out the answer like a student being called on by a teacher when he hadn’t properly memorized the lesson.","Gu Lan’s interest grew.","She extended one finger and tapped his side, her tone perfectly matter-of-fact.","“Then let me feel them.”","“!!!”","Shen Wei’s entire body stiffened. He was as rigid as a stone, too afraid to move or speak.","The music in the private room was loud enough to cover their whispers, but the floor manager had been keeping half an eye on them.","When he saw Gu Lan’s hand making its way toward Shen Wei’s clothes, his eyelid twitched.","This girl...","She looked like an innocent student. How could she be so bold?","At the tables nearby, Zhu Jiaying and the others barely even dared to make eye contact with the male models. At most, they chatted quietly. But this one had gone straight to putting her hands on him?","Zhu ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​​​​‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌‍Qichao, the male model Chen Sisi had kept, also noticed what was happening.","Seeing Shen Wei being taken advantage of, he curled his lip, secretly delighted.","Serves him right.","He’d stolen my spot, only to get groped by some female lecher anyway.","Besides, other than Chen Sisi, the rest were clearly broke students. How much could they possibly tip? He was getting touched for nothing.","Shen Wei was still locked in an intense internal struggle when Gu Lan’s finger, through the thin fabric of his uniform shirt, impatiently poked his abdomen.","Very firm.","Even through the fabric, she could feel the solid, well-defined contours beneath.","“Hurry up. Don’t be so stingy,” Gu Lan urged, a playful smile in her voice.","By now, Shen Wei’s face was red from his neck all the way to the top of his head. He closed his eyes as if resigning himself to his fate, then gave a stiff nod.","With his permission, Gu Lan made no attempt to hold back.","Her hand was small and carried a hint of coolness. It slipped beneath the hem of his shirt.","The moment her fingertips touched his warm, taut skin, Shen Wei’s entire body gave a faint shudder, and his breathing stopped for half a beat.","Gu Lan’s hand wandered over his abdomen.","One segment, two, three...","Mm. The feel was excellent. The real deal.","She could feel the muscles beneath her hand tensed rock-hard from nervousness.","When she raised her head, she met Shen Wei’s startled, deerlike eyes. His cheeks were flushed, his lips pressed tightly together, and he looked pitifully helpless, as if he had been left at someone else’s mercy.","Tsk.","Gu Lan suddenly felt that his 83-point looks had become a lot more handsome.","Sure enough, an interesting soul beneath a pretty face was the best bonus of all.","Satisfied, she withdrew her hand. Ignoring the various looks being thrown their way, she casually picked up another glass of alcohol and held it out to Shen Wei.","“Drink.”","Just one word, leaving no room for refusal.","Shen Wei was already a little dizzy, but he obediently took the glass and downed it in one gulp.","For the rest of the evening, the scene in the private room grew increasingly bizarre.","On Chen Sisi’s side, everyone revolved around her. Some were playing drinking games, others were singing, and the room was lively and raucous.","Zhu Jiaying and the others had gradually loosened up as well. Led by the male models at their table, they began playing dice.","Only Gu Lan’s corner remained unnaturally quiet.","She didn’t sing or play any games. She simply leaned back on the sofa, pushing her glass toward Shen Wei again and again, while Shen Wei, like a drinking machine devoid of emotion, drained every glass placed before him.","As she kept feeding him alcohol, Gu Lan’s hand would occasionally slip beneath his clothes, openly giving him a few good touches under the excuse of “checking whether his abs have gone soft from drinking.”","Shen Wei went from rigid resistance at the beginning, to numb acceptance later on, until finally even his eyes began to lose focus.","The floor manager watched from nearby and couldn’t help feeling sorry for him.","The poor kid had picked a terrible night for his first time entertaining a customer. He looked like a student, probably couldn’t earn much, and was getting both force-fed alcohol and taken advantage of.","The wild night finally drew to a close.","Chen Sisi had had her fill of fun and stood up to settle the bill.","Zhu Jiaying and the others were also reeling drunk, supported by their respective companions. Their faces were flushed with a mixture of satisfaction and exhaustion.","Gu Lan glanced at Shen Wei beside her, who could barely sit upright anymore.","His head hung low, tousled bangs falling over his forehead. His cheeks were flushed with alcohol, and his eyes were unfocused. He looked both pitiful and easy to bully.","Gu Lan leaned over and asked softly beside his ear, “Are you angry that I treated you this way?”","Shen Wei turned his head sluggishly and looked at her in confusion. Several seconds passed before he slowly shook his head.","That obedient appearance erased the last of Gu Lan’s urge to tease him.","She smiled and stood up.","“How should I give you your tip?”","Shen Wei seemed not to hear her. He let out another “Huh?” His eyes were hazy with moisture.","“A... a tip?” He sounded surprised. “I... I get one too?”","As far as he was concerned, he hadn’t done anything that night. He had merely sat there and kept drinking, without even managing to hold a complete conversation with the customer.","Gu Lan was amused by the look on his face.","“Of course.” She took out her phone. “Bring up your payment QR code.”","Still dizzy, Shen Wei fumbled his own phone out of his pocket. His fingers trembled as he tapped several times before finally bringing up the green QR code, which he held out to Gu Lan.","Gu Lan aimed her phone at it and scanned the code.","She paused when she reached the amount field, then quickly entered a string of numbers.","[Ding! The host has spent 100,000 yuan on a target with an appearance score of 83. Cashback of 100,000 yuan received.]","The notification announcing the successful transfer rang from Gu Lan’s phone.","Shen Wei’s phone vibrated as well, but he was already too drunk to check it.","Gu Lan put her phone away and leaned toward his ear once more, her warm breath brushing against him.","“Can I come touch you again next time?”","Shen Wei’s body went rigid again. He lifted his hazy eyes and stared at the beautiful face so close to his own. Alcohol had numbed his mind, leaving him able to answer only on instinct.","“...Y-yes.”","After a brief pause, he added very seriously, “But... no more drinking. I can’t drink anymore.”","Gu Lan let out a soft laugh.","“Okay.”","She straightened up and waved casually.","“Bye-bye!”","With that, she turned and walked over to Zhu Jiaying, who could barely stand. She slung Zhu Jiaying’s arm over her shoulder, and together with her other two roommates, staggered out of the private room.","That left only the bartender named Shen Wei, sitting alone on the sofa. He was still clutching the phone displaying a long string of digits, his eyes blank as if he still hadn’t recovered from everything that had just happened."]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: One Hundred Thousand","paragraphs":["The private-room door closed, cutting off the loud, unsteady laughter and chatter of Zhu Jiaying and her group out in the hallway.","The room fell silent in an instant. The only sound left was the pounding background music, playing on relentlessly.","Shen Wei, the bartender, was still sitting all alone on the enormous leather sofa.","He clutched his phone tightly in one hand, his head lowered. His tousled bangs hid his expression, and he sat perfectly still, looking like a forgotten statue.","After seeing off Chen Sisi and her group of demanding customers, floor manager Yang Zhiyong turned around and was met with this sight.","He sighed, walked over, and sat down beside Shen Wei, giving him a pat on the shoulder.","“Hey, Little Shen.”","There was a trace of sympathy in Yang Zhiyong’s voice—the sympathy of someone who had been around the block.","“First night out, and you run into someone like that. Talk about bad luck.”","He shook his head as he spoke.","“I misjudged her too. Who would’ve thought that little girl would look so innocent, then force drinks down you and bully you like that... What kind of nonsense is this?”","Shen Wei swayed from the pat on his shoulder. He slowly raised his head, his eyes still unfocused. Clearly, he hadn’t sobered up yet.","“I...” He opened his mouth, but couldn’t get the word out.","Just then, the male model named Zhu Qichao came over, beaming from ear to ear. He had accompanied Chen Sisi that evening and received quite a few benefits, so he was feeling particularly pleased with himself.","Hearing Yang Zhiyong’s words, he curled his lips and spoke dismissively.","“Brother Yong, what’s so unlucky about that? If you’re in this line of work, isn’t drinking with customers the most normal thing in the world?”","He looked down at Shen Wei, who was dead drunk, his tone dripping with unconcealed superiority and a hint of mockery.","“I just wonder whether you got any tip after being put through all that for the entire night.”","He deliberately drew out the last few words, then pulled out his phone and waved his payment records in front of Shen Wei.","“Sister Sisi just casually gave me a five-thousand-yuan tip.”","Several of the other male models who had accompanied Zhu Jiaying’s group moments ago came over as well.","“My table didn’t give me anything.”","“My table only gave me two hundred. Those female students really aren’t very generous.”","“Still better than nothing.”","They talked over one another, eyeing Shen Wei with gleeful curiosity.","A new bartender had been called away by customers, only to end up drunk out of his mind. He probably hadn’t gotten much money at all.","He had been taken advantage of for nothing all night.","Zhu Qichao was even more direct. He jerked his chin toward Shen Wei.","“Hey, rookie, we’re talking to you. How much did those female students at your table give you? You got a few hundred, at least, right?”","“If ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​‍you didn’t get a single cent, you really got ripped off.”","The noise was giving Shen Wei a headache. Frowning, he stared blankly at Zhu Qichao. It took him a long while to understand what they were asking.","“There... there was a tip.” His voice was soft and heavily nasal, lacking confidence.","Zhu Qichao gave a derisive laugh.","“Oh? There was? Then how much? Tell us so we can hear it and use it as a point of reference.”","“Don’t tell me she only gave you a hundred yuan for cab fare. That would be downright charity.”","Yang Zhiyong felt Zhu Qichao was going too far. He frowned and tried to smooth things over.","“All right, at least he got something.”","Then he turned to Shen Wei and asked more gently, “Little Shen, how much did she give you?”","Shen Wei lowered his head and looked at the phone screen that had been glowing in his hand the entire time.","He hadn’t paid attention to the number before. But now that they were pressing him, he took a look.","The string of zeros after the number swayed before his eyes, making his head spin.","“I... I can’t count it...” he said blankly, his voice barely audible. “...There are so many circles...”","“Pfft—”","Zhu Qichao burst out laughing, doubling over.","“Hahahaha! You can’t count it? How many circles are there? One hundred yuan has two zeros, one thousand has three. You can’t even tell that apart? I’m telling you, you really drank yourself stupid!”","The other male models joined in, laughing along. The room filled with cheerful, gleeful amusement.","Yang Zhiyong looked embarrassed too. He figured Shen Wei was either truly drunk or simply too ashamed to say the amount aloud.","He took the phone from Shen Wei’s hand.","“All right, all right. I’ll take a look. It’s not a big deal.”","He lowered his head toward the screen and muttered casually, “Let’s see which idiot only gave you that little...”","His voice cut off abruptly.","The smile on Yang Zhiyong’s face froze.","He stood there rigidly, staring at the phone screen. One second, two seconds, three...","He even raised a hand to rub his eyes before bringing the phone closer—so close it was practically pressed against his face.","Beside him, Zhu Qichao was still laughing.","“What’s wrong, Brother Yong? Did that little bit of money scare you? Was it a hundred or two hundred? What’s got you so shocked?”","Yang Zhiyong ignored him.","His Adam’s apple bobbed as he forced a single word through clenched teeth.","“F—holy shit!”","The volume wasn’t high, but the word carried with strange force, instantly silencing the laughter throughout the private room.","Everyone stopped and looked at Yang Zhiyong.","The smile on Zhu Qichao’s face faded as well. He frowned. “What the hell? How much was it to get that reaction out of you?”","As he spoke, he impatiently moved closer and glanced at the phone screen.","The next second, his expression became identical to Yang Zhiyong’s just moments earlier.","No—in fact, it was even more spectacular.","His eyes flew wide, his mouth fell open, and the color drained from his face at a visibly shocking speed. The smug flush of triumph turned into a deathly white pallor.","“Te... te... ten...”","He stammered as though his tongue had tied itself in knots, unable to force out the word “thousand.”","The other male models had long since been unable to contain their curiosity. They swarmed over, craning their necks to look at the tiny phone screen.","Then the entire private room fell into deathly silence.","Every one of them saw it.","On the phone screen, the WeChat payment page clearly displayed a number so staggering that it seemed to stop their breathing.","Payment received: ¥100,000.00.","One hundred thousand.","A full one hundred thousand.","Not one zero more, not one zero less.","The air seemed to solidify.","The male models who had been chattering about tips of eight hundred or a thousand yuan only moments earlier were now completely speechless. They stood there with their mouths hanging open, their faces filled with absurd disbelief.","The deathly pallor of Zhu Qichao’s face slowly deepened into the color of liver.","He had just been bragging about his five-thousand-yuan tip.","But compared with this hundred thousand, his five thousand was nothing more than a joke.","A colossal joke.","His face burned as if someone had slapped him hard a dozen times.","“Fake... It has to be fake, right?” one of the male models said stiffly, breaking the silence. “This... this is a photoshopped image, isn’t it?”","Yang Zhiyong finally came back to himself. His fingers trembling, he swiped across the screen and opened the transfer details.","The transfer time, the sender’s name—Gu Lan—everything was laid out clearly.","It was real.","Yang Zhiyong sucked in a sharp breath. The sound echoed through the entire private room.","When he looked at Shen Wei again, his expression had completely changed.","Pity? Sympathy?","They were all gone.","In their place was a complicated mix of shock, envy, jealousy, and even a trace of... awe.","Carefully, he returned the phone to Shen Wei with both hands, moving as gently as if it were not a phone at all, but a priceless, one-of-a-kind treasure.","“L-Little Shen...”","Yang Zhiyong’s voice had even changed pitch, carrying a hint of ingratiation he himself failed to notice.","He leaned close to Shen Wei’s ear and lowered his voice, asking urgently, “That young woman just now... the one who transferred the money to you... What did she say to you before she left?”","Shen Wei was even more confused by his reaction.","He struggled to reconstruct the scene in his alcohol-fogged mind.","The beautiful girl leaning close to his ear, the warmth of her breath, and those words...","Shen Wei’s face suddenly flushed again, this time all the way to the tips of his ears.","He lowered his head shyly, his voice as soft as a mosquito’s hum.","“She... she said...”","“She said she’d come back next time... for me...”","Yang Zhiyong’s eyes instantly widened.","He stood frozen for several seconds before suddenly slapping his thigh, his face filled with a mixture of extreme envy and regret.","“What luck! You really know how to live, kid!”","He muttered to himself. When he looked at Shen Wei again, it was as if he were looking at a walking gold mine.","Just moments ago, he had been feeling sorry for the kid—getting force-fed drinks and taken advantage of?","Taken advantage of, my ass!","This wasn’t being taken advantage of at all. This was a fortune falling from the heavens! Gold bars raining from the sky!","A young, beautiful rich woman had casually given him a hundred thousand yuan just to touch his abs?","Who was taking advantage of whom was still up for debate!","That hundred thousand was more than everyone in the entire establishment had spent tonight combined!","A storm of emotions instantly raged through Yang Zhiyong’s heart.","He glanced at Zhu Qichao, whose expression had turned unbearably ugly, then at the group of male models standing around them, all of whom were staring in stunned silence.","Finally, his gaze returned to Shen Wei, who still looked utterly bewildered and had no idea what kind of commotion he had caused.","It was Shen Wei’s very first time accompanying a client, and he had already encountered a hidden tycoon like this.","The kid’s luck was practically heaven-defying."]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Lazy Sheep's 5,200 Breakfast","paragraphs":["By the time the girls supported one another and sneaked back to their dorm like thieves, it was already past midnight.","Zhu ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​‍Jiaying and Wu Luyi’s cheeks were flushed, and they were still humming tunelessly. Liu Anyáo followed behind, responsible for closing the door and keeping everyone quiet, constantly making a “shh” gesture.","Gu Lan had the best tolerance for alcohol. Even now, she was only slightly tipsy. She helped the two drunken cats into bed, then quickly washed up and dove under the covers, like a little animal returning to its nest.","The dorm was quiet, with only the steady sound of her roommates’ breathing.","She pulled her phone out from under her pillow and opened the familiar green app—Oxygen.","The moment she logged on, a chat window popped up. It was the man who had put her in such a good mood that evening.","【Wn.Xu: Back at the dorm?】","Gu Lan was a little surprised. Her fingers flew across the screen.","【Food Liu You: Mm-hmm! I’m getting ready for bed! How did you know I was back?】","【Wn.Xu: I saw you come online.】","【Wn.Xu: Want me to sing you to sleep?】","Gu Lan pressed the phone against her face. The cool screen seemed to carry the warmth of his voice, and she couldn’t help smiling.","【Food Liu You: Yes! Add me to a private chat?】","【Wn.Xu: Okay.】","The private voice-chat invitation arrived soon after. Gu Lan put on her earphones, and the entire world instantly shrank to nothing but that clear, slightly lazy male voice.","Without any unnecessary small talk, he seemed to know that she was tired and began humming softly.","His voice seemed to possess a kind of magic, soothing all her restlessness and fatigue.","Curled up in the soft blankets with her eyes closed, Gu Lan felt the image of the boy named Shen Wei whom she had met at the club earlier that night—and the system notification announcing the transfer of one hundred thousand yuan—washed away completely by the sound of his singing.","An hour later, the singing stopped.","A very soft call came through the earphones.","“Lamb? Are you asleep?”","Gu Lan didn’t answer. She simply made her breathing even lighter.","After waiting for a while, he seemed to confirm that she had fallen asleep. A nearly inaudible sigh came through, followed by two words spoken with infinite tenderness.","“Good night.”","The next morning, Gu Lan woke to the vibration of her phone.","There were no classes that morning. Sunlight streamed through a gap in the curtains and landed directly on her face. Squinting, she reached for her phone and saw messages from Wn.Xu on the screen.","One said, “Good morning.”","The other was a red transfer notification.","Gu Lan tapped it open.","—Transfer amount: 5,200.00 yuan.","Beneath the transfer was a short note: Remember to eat breakfast.","Gu Lan: “...”","Her sleepiness vanished instantly, leaving her wide awake.","Was this man raising her like a pig? Five thousand two hundred yuan for breakfast?","Her fingers flew over the screen.","【Food Liu You: 5,200? Do you think I’m a pig?】","The moment she sent it, the other party replied.","【Wn.Xu: Does Lazy Lamb eat a lot?】","He even added an innocent shrugging emoji.","Gu Lan was so annoyed that she laughed. She replied with a sticker of a little person beating someone with a hammer.","【Food Liu You: (angry).jpg I’m going shopping!】","【Wn.Xu: Shopping again?】","【Food Liu You: I’m going to buy, buy, buy! When are you on shift? I’ll come keep you company!】","【Wn.Xu: Seven in the evening to one in the morning.】","【Food Liu You: Great! See you at seven!】","Gu Lan tossed her phone onto the bed, then sat bolt upright and shouted at her roommates, who were still deep in sleep:","“Girls! Get up! We’re going shopping!”","“None of you are allowed to sleep anymore! This rich girl is taking you out to spend some money today!”","Half an hour later, four young and stylish female college students appeared at the city’s most upscale shopping mall.","Zhu Jiaying was still a little dazed. “Lanlan, didn’t you say we were going shopping? Why did you bring us here? Everything here is insanely expensive.”","Wu Luyi nodded in agreement. “Exactly! Can’t we just go to the supermarket next door and buy some snacks?”","Only Liu Anyáo remained silent as she looked at Gu Lan, seemingly having already guessed what was going on.","With one arm around each of the girls, Gu Lan announced boldly, “I came here with almost nothing when school started, so today I’m going to replace everything from head to toe!”","“Besides, I have plenty of spending money!”","Ignoring her roommates’ shocked expressions, she pulled them straight to the counter of an international luxury skincare brand.","“Hello. Please bring us four sets of this collection.” Gu Lan pointed to a beautifully packaged complete skincare set on the counter, marked at 5,888 yuan, and spoke to the sales clerk.","The clerk’s eyes lit up instantly, and her smile became more than ten times warmer.","Behind her, the three roommates had turned completely to stone.","Zhu Jiaying tugged at Gu Lan’s sleeve and stammered, “Lan... Lanlan, this... this set costs more than five thousand yuan! Four sets would be over twenty thousand!”","“No, no, it’s fine! I’m perfectly happy using cucumber toner from the supermarket that costs a few dozen yuan!” Wu Luyi hurriedly waved her hands.","Gu Lan didn’t even turn her head. She simply pulled out her card.","“Charge it.”","As they watched the black card glide across the card reader, followed by Gu Lan signing her name without so much as a change in expression, Zhu Jiaying and the others felt as if their entire worldview had been violently shaken.","“Lanlan... how much spending money do you actually have?” Zhu Jiaying asked, holding the heavy bag of skincare products as if she were dreaming.","Gu Lan gave her a mysterious smile. “That’s a secret.”","Only then did they truly understand what Gu Lan meant by “plenty of spending money.”","She took them from the jewelry counters on the first floor to the designer clothing stores on the second, then to the luxury shoes and handbags on the third.","“This bracelet is pretty. It would suit you, Jiaying. Wrap it up.”","“This Lolita dress is from this year’s new collection, right? It’ll look adorable on you, Luyi. I’ll take it.”","“Anyáo, these high heels would really suit your style. Try them on.”","“Excuse me, wrap up these pieces, these pieces, and that one too.”","She was like a mindless card-swiping machine. Wherever she went, she left behind nothing but a string of heart-stopping receipts.","Finally, after the four of them had accumulated dozens of shopping bags and settled into the upscale Western restaurant on the top floor—where the average diner spent more than a thousand yuan—Zhu Jiaying could hold back no longer.","She put down her knife and fork and stared solemnly at Gu Lan.","“Gu Lan! Confess and you’ll be treated leniently; resist and you’ll face the consequences! Did you awaken some kind of tycoon system?!”","Wu Luyi leaned over as well and lowered her voice. “Or are you secretly the daughter of some financial magnate, here at our university to experience life among ordinary people?”","Although Liu Anyáo said nothing, she also set down the book in her hands, clearly curious about the answer.","Gu Lan nearly spit out her steak.","After finally swallowing, she looked at them helplessly. “With imaginations like yours, it’s a waste that you aren’t writing novels.”","“Come on, tell us!” Zhu Jiaying urged. “You’ve spent at least—” She didn’t even dare calculate the total. “At least over a hundred thousand today, right? Does your family own a bank?”","Gu Lan thought for a moment, then decided to reveal a little—half truth, half lie. “It’s just... my family gives me a relatively generous allowance.”","The downside of a major shopping spree was that by the time they returned to their dorm, all four of them were completely exhausted.","Looking at the shopping bags piled on the floor like a small mountain, Zhu Jiaying suddenly remembered something. She shot upright in bed.","“Oh, right, Lanlan! Last night, at the club, how much of a tip did you give that bartender?”","At once, the other two girls’ gossip-loving spirits flared to life. All three turned to look at Gu Lan.","Gu Lan was in the middle of opening a jewelry box. Without even looking up, she replied, “Not that much. Just tens of thousands.”","“How much is ‘tens of thousands’?” Liu Anyáo pressed, unusually persistent.","Gu Lan opened the box and took out a delicate diamond bracelet, holding it against her wrist to see how it looked. Her tone was as casual as if she were commenting on the weather.","“One hundred thousand.”","The dorm fell into deathly silence.","Three pairs of eyes stared fixedly at Gu Lan. Their expressions shifted from curiosity to shock, then to stunned disbelief, and finally went completely blank.","After a full half minute, Wu Luyi finally turned stiffly and reached for her phone.","“I... I’m calling my brother right now.”","Her voice trembled with a dreamlike excitement.","“This is the best time ever to get into the male-model business!”"]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: No Charity for the Rich","paragraphs":["6:58 p.m.","Gu Lan had just finished showering. Her hair was still damp, draped over her shoulders, but she couldn’t wait to snuggle under the covers.","Holding her phone up in front of her face, she tapped into the Oxygen app. The Goodnight Melody voice-chat room was lit up.","She timed it perfectly and entered at exactly seven.","Welcome messages flooded the public chat almost all at once.","[System Notification] Food Liu You entered Goodnight Melody right on the heels of Wn.Xu!","[Salted Pomelo: Lamb is here!!!!]","[Squid Strips: Right on time, right on the dot! Ready to clock in and keep you company!]","[Little Loser: She really did step on Xu’s tail hahahahahahahaha!]","Xu was speaking from Mic 1, his clear, mellow voice carrying a smile. “Welcome, Lamb.”","Volcano on Mic 2 immediately chimed in, warm and enthusiastic. “Yo! Lamb Sis is here! Long time no see!—Though it’s only been a day.”","Yechen on Mic 4 was even more excited. “She’s here, she’s here! She’s here! Our source of happiness is here—”","Gu Lan grinned and typed in the public chat.","[Food Liu You: Hehe, missed you guys. Mostly Teacher Xu.]","[Salted Pomelo: I knew it!]","[Squid Strips: You don’t miss us? That’s so sad!]","Xu cleared his throat. “Thanks, Lamb. Then I’ll sing you—”","Before he could finish, a particularly eye-catching system notification suddenly appeared in the room. The gold lettering came with the exclusive special effects reserved for max-level accounts, and the entire public chat shook from the impact.","[System Notification] Lv. MAX I’m Invincible has descended upon Goodnight Melody!","Messages immediately began flooding the public chat.","[Little Loser: ???]","[One-Punch Wonder: Oh my god!! A max-level account!! It’s Invincible Bro!!]","[Salted Pomelo: Doesn’t Invincible Bro usually hang out in the girls’ rooms??]","[Squid Strips: A max-level account... Greetings, big shot!]","Xu on Mic 1 paused noticeably, but he recovered quickly, his voice remaining calm and steady. “Welcome to Goodnight Melody, Invincible Bro.”","Volcano on Mic 2 quickly followed up. “Hello, Invincible Bro! Welcome, welcome! What brings you here today?”","Yechen on Mic 4 joined in as well. “The big shot has arrived!”","The other streamers on the remaining mics also began greeting him. The atmosphere in the room shifted from relaxed to subtly tense in an instant.","Everyone present knew exactly what a max-level account meant on Oxygen.","However, the big shot clearly hadn’t come just to pay a visit.","A rough, booming male voice went straight onto Mic 8. His first words were like a basin of cold water dumped into a pot that had just reached a boil.","“Food Liu You?”","Gu Lan was typing in the public chat. Her fingers stopped.","“You’re the one trying to ride Sister Yaya’s coattails?”","The public chat fell silent.","Not the kind of silence that meant no one was talking. Everyone was frantically typing, then collectively deleting their messages, too afraid to send them.","Gu Lan blinked at the glittering ID and quickly ran through the possibilities in her head.","Yaya.","Previously, someone in the public chat had compared her to Oxygen’s number-one tycoon, Yaya~, saying things like, “The new tycoon Food Liu You is even more generous than Yaya.”","She hadn’t taken it seriously at all. After all, those were just the words of some random passerby. What did they have to do with her?","And yet, the other person’s friend had come knocking.","Xu on Mic 1 spoke first. His voice was unhurried and soothing. “Invincible Bro, I’m sorry. At the time, a passerby compared Lamb to Yaya in the public chat. Lamb didn’t make the comparison herself. This is all a misunderstanding.”","“A misunderstanding?” I’m Invincible snorted. “She didn’t deny what the passerby said, which means she accepted it.”","Volcano tried to help smooth things over. “Invincible Bro, please calm down. This really was—”","“It has nothing to do with you.” I’m Invincible cut him off directly. His tone was aggressive, but not outright offensive. “I’m here to talk to Food Liu You.”","The dozens of people in the room held their breath, waiting to see how Gu Lan would respond.","At last, the account with the goofy avatar of a lazy sheep poked its head into the public chat.","[Food Liu You: ? I didn’t try to ride anyone’s coattails, okay?]","[Food Liu You: Ever since surveillance cameras were invented, I haven’t done anything like that in years.]","The public chat fell silent for half a second.","Then—","[Little Loser: Pfft hahahahahahahahahaha!]","[One-Punch Wonder: Is she being serious? Hahahahahaha!!]","[Salted Pomelo: No... The big shot is angry, and you’re doing stand-up comedy??]","On Mic 8, I’m Invincible clearly couldn’t hold it in either.","“Pfft—”","A short, stifled laugh escaped through the mic, followed by a muffled, wheezing struggle to contain himself.","But after two seconds, he pulled his intimidating air back together. His voice was even louder than before, as if he were annoyed at himself for laughing.","“Don’t change the subject! No matter what, someone compared you to Sister Yaya, so you need to give me an explanation!”","He paused, then added with a domineering edge, “I challenge you to a PK!”","The public chat exploded.","[Squid Strips: !!! A PK!!]","[Little Loser: We’re doomed, we’re doomed, we’re doomed, we’re doomed!!]","[One-Punch Wonder: Invincible Bro is challenging someone to a PK... Didn’t he crush the other tycoon by nearly a million last time??]","[Salted Pomelo: Lamb, run!!!]","Gu Lan leaned against her pillow and watched as a small system window silently popped up.","[System Notification: Target “I’m Invincible” detected. Attractiveness rating: 89.]","89.","Gu Lan raised an eyebrow.","For I’m Invincible to have reached max level on Oxygen... that meant he was wealthy to begin with.","Do charity work for rich people?","She was a class warrior against the wealthy.","Declined.","Thanks anyway.","Gu Lan rapidly typed a line into the public chat.","[Food Liu You: Sure.]","Xu on Mic 1 fell silent.","But almost at the exact same moment, Gu Lan’s private messages lit up. One message after another popped up.","[Wn.Xu: Lamb.]","[Wn.Xu: Don’t act on impulse.]","[Wn.Xu: He’s famous on Oxygen for throwing money around. He dropped a million in a single PK last month. Don’t go head-to-head with him. I’ll explain everything to him.]","Gu Lan stared at Xu’s rapid-fire messages, the corners of her lips curling upward.","Someone who usually took his time replying was now typing as fast as a programmer racing to meet a deadline.","She sent back a message.","[Food Liu You: I don’t really want to do a PK either~]","[Wn.Xu: ?]","[Wn.Xu: Then why did you accept? (You little troublemaker).jpg]","[Food Liu You: I just wanted to send you some gifts~ A PK is the perfect excuse, isn’t it?]","There ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‍was a three-second pause on the other end.","[Wn.Xu: ...Now is not the time to flirt with me.]","Gu Lan covered her mouth and laughed silently, almost jamming her phone into her face.","But she also knew Xu was genuinely worried, so she stopped teasing him and switched back to the public chat.","The room was now as lively as a festival. On Mic 8, I’m Invincible urged her on. “Well? Give me a straight answer!”","Gu Lan typed:","[Food Liu You: When should we schedule the PK?]","【I'm Invincible: Tomorrow at 4 p.m.】","【Food Liu You: No, I have class. How about 7 tonight?】","There was a pause on 8Mic’s end. Even that brash male voice seemed to falter.","“Seven... Seven won’t work. I have evening study hall.”"]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Has the aura of a broke loser been marinated into you","paragraphs":["The public chat was silent for a moment.","Then it descended into complete chaos.","【Little Wimp: Wait... evening self-study???】","【One Punch Will Crush You: I didn’t hear that wrong, did I?? Even a maxed-out big shot like Invincible Bro has evening self-study??】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Hahahahahahahahahaha, one of them has class and the other has evening self-study??】","【Squid Strips: Are you two elementary school kids arranging a fight??? Got the guts to stay after class and settle it then!!】","【Little Wimp: Hahaha, why don’t you schedule it during morning reading time!】","【One Punch Will Crush You: How about eleven or twelve? Will the school be turning out the lights by then???】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: I’m dying, I’m really dying laughing!!】","Gu Lan watched the screen fill with hahaha’s and started laughing too.","I'm Invincible was clearly having trouble saving face on the mic. His voice rose an octave. “What are you laughing at! I was... I was at a training session! Not evening self-study!”","No one believed him.","Gu Lan tactfully typed a line.","【Food Liu You: How about eleven? That work?】","Mic 8 was silent for two seconds.","“Fine!” I'm Invincible agreed through gritted teeth. “Eleven! Then I’ll have the Red Sleeve Girls’ Room connect with you guys. Two rooms, one official PK!”","【Food Liu You: All right, all right.】","After typing that, Gu Lan quickly added another message, her tone so miserable that she sounded like an innocent citizen being dragged to the execution grounds.","【Food Liu You: Ugh! As if our already struggling family didn’t have enough problems!! I have to go nod, shake my head, and blink now!!】","【I'm Invincible: Don’t act pitiful. I won’t go easy on you. (Angry).jpg】","【I'm Invincible: Tomorrow at eleven. Don’t be late.】","As soon as he finished speaking, a flash of golden light appeared in the system notification—","【System Notification】I'm Invincible has left Melody of the Night.","He had arrived quickly and left even faster, like a tornado.","The room fell silent for a moment before erupting into chatter.","After word of the PK spread, the atmosphere in Melody of the Night became somewhat strange.","Xu continued hosting from Mic 1 as usual, singing two songs for the fans. But the public chat was noticeably busier than normal, with more than half the messages discussing tomorrow’s PK.","【Salted Pomelo Pear: Lamb, are you really going to do it? I’m so worried...】","【Squid Strips: Invincible Bro dropped a million in a single PK last month...】","【Little Wimp: Why don’t we just admit defeat? Losing face is temporary, but your money is yours!】","Gu Lan read the messages in the public chat, rolled over, and wrapped herself more tightly in her blanket.","After Xu finished singing a song, he paused for several seconds before speaking in his usual unhurried manner. “Everyone, there’s no need to be so nervous. PKs are about winning and losing. Just keep a level head.”","Volcano immediately chimed in. “Exactly, exactly! Losing to Invincible Bro doesn’t count as embarrassing. It counts as—” He paused. “It counts as giving him the respect he deserves.”","Ears also joined in. “That’s right, Lamb. Don’t do anything you’ll regret just to win. It isn’t worth it.”","Even Qing, who was usually quiet, posted a message in the public chat:","【Wn.Qing: ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌​​​​‌‌​‌​‌​​‌‌​​​‌​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‍Big Sister Lamb, good luck. We’ll support you no matter whether you win or lose.】","Gu Lan looked at the screen full of comforting messages, and the corner of her mouth twitched.","All right, then.","From top to bottom, not a single person thought she could win.","Fine.","She couldn’t really blame them.","She had pretended to be poor when she wasn’t, and somehow no one had seen through her act of playing the fool to catch the tiger.","Had her poor-girl aura really been marinating that deeply?","Had it seeped all the way into her bones?","Gu Lan buried her face in the blanket and chuckled before typing into the public chat.","【Food Liu You: You all think I’m going to lose?? That’s so mean! I’m hurt!】","【Salted Pomelo Pear: No, no, we’re just afraid you’ll get carried away!】","【Little Wimp: Lamb, please don’t let your emotions get the better of you!】","Gu Lan switched to Xu’s private messages and quickly typed a line.","【Food Liu You: Teacher Xu, if I lose, you have to comfort me properly.】","Several seconds passed before the reply came.","【Wn.Xu: (Okay).jpg】","She added another message.","【Food Liu You: How will you comfort me? Be specific.】","【Wn.Xu: I’ll record you a playlist of lullabies? And sing you to sleep every day?】","【Food Liu You: (Cold).jpg】","【Wn.Xu: Then what kind of comfort does Lamb want?】","【Food Liu You: Let me see your abs.】","【Wn.Xu: ...Fine.】","Gu Lan locked her phone and rolled over. Her eyes were closed, but the corners of her mouth stayed lifted.","On the bed beside hers, Zhu Jiaying poked her head over and stared at her for a long while. In the end, she couldn’t help muttering, “That smile of yours is seriously creepy.”","...","Meanwhile, on the trending list of Oxygen’s Confession Wall, one post had been pushed to the homepage.","The title was blunt:","【Shocking! Max-Level Tycoon “I'm Invincible” Challenges New Big Sister “Food Liu You” to a Showdown! Live Mic PK Tomorrow at 11 P.M.!】","The comment section instantly turned into a massive spectator event.","【Daydream Patient: I'm Invincible is a veteran tycoon on Oxygen. He’s been spending money here for years. How long has Food Liu You even been around? It’s a guaranteed win.】","【Can't Get Up: You can’t say that for sure, can you? Food dropped ten Black Gold gifts in one go before, spending nearly three hundred thousand on the spot without even blinking! How is that a newcomer with no money?】","【Mm-Hmm, Okay: But look at Invincible Bro’s past record. Last time he did a PK, he dropped a million and completely crushed the other side. Can Food really take him on?】","【Daydream Patient: That level isn’t something an ordinary person can compete with. I’m betting on Invincible Bro.】","After several more comments, a new ID suddenly appeared. The account had been registered for barely two hours, and its profile picture was the default gray silhouette.","【What Should I Eat Today?: Food is a poor loser who borrowed money to spend on gifts. Invincible Bro is guaranteed to win.】","The comment section immediately exploded.","【Can't Get Up: Huh? Borrowed money to spend? Are you serious? What random troll account is this?】","【What Should I Eat Today?: I’m stating a fact. Think about it yourself. A nobody with a brand-new account shows up and drops hundreds of thousands right away. If an ordinary person had that kind of money, why wouldn’t they invest it? Obviously, she borrowed money to indulge in reckless spending.】","【Mm-Hmm, Okay: Now that you mention it... that kind of makes sense?? Is it true?】","【Daydream Patient: Hard to say. If she really spent borrowed money, that would be terrifying. But true or not, Invincible Bro is guaranteed to win.】","【Working Binge-Watcher: I’m definitely watching the PK tomorrow at eleven! I need to see this drama with my own eyes!】","【Daydream Patient: I usually go to bed at ten, but I’m going to stay up late for this PK!】","【Can't Get Up: You go to bed at ten? Are you eighty?】","【Daydream Patient: ...Is that any way to talk to people?】","The Confession Wall post racked up more than five hundred comments in barely half an hour, and its number of reposts continued climbing.","Everyone on Oxygen knew about it—","There would be a good show tomorrow night at eleven.","...","At the same time, the streamer group chat for Melody of the Night was just as lively.","The room owner, Garlic Paste, was the first to send a message.","【Garlic Paste: Everyone, be more active before tomorrow’s PK and keep the atmosphere lively. Let’s see if we can use this wave of attention to retain some visitors. The room’s peak number of viewers today was forty percent higher than usual, all of them here for the spectacle. Even if we lose, we’re not really at a disadvantage. After all, it’s Food Liu You who’ll be losing face.】","The group was silent for several seconds.","Yechen was the first to speak up.","【Wn.Yechen: Exactly. Some people just love pretending to be big spenders. Well, look at her now—she’s finally run into someone she can’t mess with.】","【Wn.Yechen: When she loses everything, let’s see how she’ll survive on Oxygen.】","【Wn.Muzhi: (eating popcorn).jpg】","The group fell silent again for a while.","The next message came from Xu.","【Wn.Xu: @Wn.Yechen, watch your mouth.】","Yechen stopped talking.","Ears immediately typed out a message.","【Wn.Ears: Do you people even hear yourselves? Even if I'm Invincible can spend like crazy, he’s still someone else’s big brother, while food is our big sister. Big Sister Lamb is going to war, and you’re going to hide behind her?】","【Volcano: I agree. Big Sister Lamb is a sister who spends money in our room. No matter who she spends it on, we have to stand with her. That’s basic loyalty.】","【Wn.Qing: Agreed. Support Big Sister Lamb.】"]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Order Three Bottles of 88888 Whisky","paragraphs":["The mood in the group was clearly starting to swing toward one side.","Then Muzhi sent a message.","【Wn.Muzhi: Our “big sis”? She’s only ever sent gifts to Xu and Qing. Has she sent even a penny to any of you? Volcano, you’re going all out for her—has she ever sent you a gift? Don’t make it sound like you two are that close.】","【Wn.Volcano: Brother Muzhi, I don’t agree with you.】","【Wn.Volcano: As streamers, we can’t only acknowledge the people who spend money on us. Any sister who spends money in the channel, no matter who she spends it on, is supporting our whole channel. You understand that, don’t you?】","Muzhi didn’t reply.","But the channel owner, Garlic Paste, sent another message.","【Garlic Paste: All right, all right, stop arguing. Let me make this clear: I can’t afford to offend the “I’m Invincible” crowd. The last channel that crossed him got hammered until its popularity dropped to zero. Think carefully about that yourselves. Who knows whether Food Liu You’s spending is just an impulsive purchase made with a loan? What if she asks for a refund later? Wouldn’t all our effort be wasted?】","【Garlic Paste: Anyway, I want everyone active tomorrow. As long as she shows up, that’s enough. As for which side you support, I won’t force anyone. In any case, I’m not taking a position.】","He sounded very “fair.”","But everyone could hear what he really meant: refusing to take a position meant refusing to stand with Gu Lan.","The group chat ended there.","...","At that moment, Gu Lan was holding her phone, reading through the chat logs of the streamers’ group that the system had forwarded to her one by one.","After finishing, she slowly placed the phone against her chest and stared at the switched-off ceiling light in the dorm room.","She rolled over, picked up her phone again, and ignored all the upsetting messages in the group. Instead, she opened Xu’s private messages and typed:","【Food Liu You: Xu, cheer me on tomorrow, okay? I want the kind where you say it to me personally.】","More than ten seconds later, a reply came.","【Wn.Xu: Go, Lamb.】","Gu Lan stared at the screen and typed unhappily:","【Food Liu You: That’s it? You’re being way too perfunctory!】","【Wn.Xu: What kind do you want? (scratches head).jpg】","【Food Liu You: Make it more heartfelt! Put some emotion into it! The kind that gets my blood boiling when I hear it!】","The other end fell silent for several seconds.","【Wn.Xu: ...Give me a moment to prepare.】","Gu Lan was so delighted that she rolled around under the covers, twisting the blanket into a tangled mess.","From the neighboring bed, Zhu Jiaying mumbled sleepily, “Gu Lan, if you keep rolling around, I’m tying you to the bedpost.”","Gu Lan stayed still for two seconds, then continued rolling soundlessly.","Tomorrow at eleven.","She’d see who was the iron plate and who was the egg.","Hmph!","...","After a full day of classes, Gu Lan returned to the dorm just before six.","The four girls gathered to eat takeout. Zhu Jiaying gnawed on a chicken leg and asked, “Why were you so distracted today? You didn’t even fall asleep during calculus this morning. You just sat there staring at your phone and giggling. The professor looked at you several times.”","Gu Lan chewed a mouthful of rice and said indistinctly, “I was researching a topic.”","“What topic?”","“Whether appropriate giggling is beneficial to physical and mental health.”","Zhu Jiaying nearly choked on her chicken leg.","After dinner, Gu Lan lay on her bed, scrolling through her phone. Before long, she came across the photos she had taken at Golden Night last time.","Shen Wei.","She zoomed in and stared at him for two seconds.","That face really was handsome. Not the carefully groomed kind of handsome, but a raw, awkward sort of good looks that he seemed completely unaware of.","The last time she had touched his abs, his entire ears had turned bright red. He had looked just like a boiled shrimp.","Gu Lan rolled over, and a thought popped into her head.","The PK was at eleven tonight, and it was only six now.","What was she supposed to do for the next five hours?","Since she was free anyway...","She sat up, changed into a dress, grabbed her purse, and headed out.","Zhu Jiaying called after her, “Where are you going?”","“To work on my research.”","...","By the time her taxi reached Golden Night, it was just after seven.","The neon sign outside the club had only just lit up. Gu Lan pushed open the door and walked to the front desk. She was about to ask whether Shen Wei was working that day when a figure suddenly sprang over from the side, moving so quickly it was as if he had a spring attached to him.","Yang Zhiyong.","The floor manager of Golden Night was dressed in a black vest, his hair combed flawlessly into place. The smile on his face was the very definition of a professional service smile.","“Oh, hello! Welcome! You’re here to see Xiaowei, aren’t you?”","Gu Lan blinked.","She had only been inside for three seconds and hadn’t even said a word.","Did this guy have facial-recognition software installed?","As he spoke, Yang Zhiyong gestured toward the interior. “Xiaowei is in a private room promoting drinks. I’ll go get him for you—”","“No need.” Gu Lan waved her hand. “I’ll get a private room and wait for him.”","Yang ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​‌‍Zhiyong was just about to respond when two figures hurried over from the other side of the lobby.","Xu Yang and Zhu Qichao.","Xu Yang walked in front, wearing a sharply tailored dark-gray shirt with two buttons undone at the collar. His face carried a polished, friendly smile, and his voice was lowered to just the right degree.","“Big sis! You’re here again tonight? Why don’t I keep you company?”","Zhu Qichao hurried up behind him. “You can pick me too, sis! I sing better than Xiaowei, and I can hold my liquor better than him!”","The two of them flanked her like a pair of birds fighting over food.","Gu Lan glanced at them.","Then she gave them a polite smile. “I’m waiting for Shen Wei in the private room. Once he’s finished, just have him come over.”","Xu Yang’s smile froze for an instant.","Zhu Qichao’s expression didn’t look much better.","That clueless newcomer Shen Wei, who couldn’t even pour a drink properly, had made a hundred thousand yuan in tips in a single night.","And tonight, this big spender had specifically asked for him again?","A hundred thousand yuan.","The two of them had worked as male models for more than half a year, and the biggest tip either of them had ever received in one sitting was only a little over twenty thousand. Shen Wei was just an intern bartender, yet after half a month on the job, he had already stumbled into a client like this.","It was as if the heavens had gone blind.","Yang Zhiyong turned and shot the two men a look. The meaning was perfectly clear: Don’t get in the way of business.","Xu Yang and Zhu Qichao reluctantly moved aside.","Yang Zhiyong immediately put his smile back on and personally led Gu Lan inside. He opened the door to a private room, where the lighting was soft and the leather sofa gleamed.","“Please have a seat. I’ll have some fruit and drinks brought over.”","Gu Lan leaned back on the sofa and asked casually, “About how long until Shen Wei is done?”","“He still has three bottles of liquor left to promote. He should be finished soon,” Yang Zhiyong replied with a smile. “I’ll go hurry him along in a bit.”","Three bottles of liquor.","Gu Lan’s eyes shifted.","She silently poked the system in her mind.","“If I buy the drinks Shen Wei is supposed to sell, does that count as spending?”","The system answered instantly: 【Of course it does! The recipient of the spending has a looks score of 83, so you’ll get a one-to-one cashback return! It’s not as good as the ten-to-one return for a handsome guy with a score of 90 or higher, but it’s still free money!】","Gu Lan: “All right.”","She waved Yang Zhiyong over. “Brother Yang, I’ll cover those three bottles for Shen Wei. Let me see the drink menu.”","Yang Zhiyong froze. Then the smile on his face split even wider, and he swiftly pulled out the tablet he carried with him and handed it over.","“You’re too kind!” He pointed at a bottle with a pink label on the screen. “This one is perfect for ladies, and it tastes great too. Only six hundred yuan a bottle—”","Gu Lan ignored that bottle and slowly scrolled down the menu with her finger.","The 600-yuan ones, the 1,200-yuan ones, the 3,800-yuan ones, the 12,000-yuan ones...","Her finger stopped.","88,888 yuan.","A bottle of whisky priced at 88,888 yuan. The bottle was matte black and gold, and she hadn’t even bothered to look closely at the name.","At that price, it clearly wasn’t the liquor they were selling—it was the prestige and the tips.","Gu Lan pointed at the bottle. “That one. Bring me three.”","Yang Zhiyong’s smile froze.","“Huh?”","“Three bottles.” Gu Lan took a card from her bag. “Run the card.”","88,888 times three.","266,664 yuan.","By the time Yang Zhiyong carried the card to the payment terminal, his hands were shaking.","He had been in the business for six years. He’d sold bottles of 88,888-yuan whisky before, but three bottles in a single order—","That was a first.","“Beep—”","Transaction approved.","Yang Zhiyong stared at the amount on the receipt. The expression on his face went through at least five distinct stages before finally settling into a dazed, dreamlike grin.","He walked out of the private room clutching the receipt, his footsteps practically floating.","When he passed the front desk, he pulled out his phone and opened the club’s work chat.","[Floor Manager—Yang Zhiyong: Congratulations to Shen Wei on closing a sale. Three bottles of 88,888-yuan liquor. Total: 266,664 yuan.]","The group chat was silent for a full eight seconds.","Then it exploded.","[Male Model—Xu Yang: ???]","[Male Model—Zhu Qichao: What?? Who bought the 88,888-yuan liquor?? Three bottles???]","[Bartender—Kang: Wait, wasn’t the 88,888-yuan bottle just for display? We only sold one last month!]","[Male Model—Zhao Lei: Three bottles all at once? What kind of client is this???]","[Front Desk—Xiao Zhou: Shen Wei?? The intern who’s only been here for half a month???]","[Male Model—Xu Yang: He’s a bartender. How did he close the sale? Did you get something wrong? @Floor Manager—Yang Zhiyong]","[Floor Manager—Yang Zhiyong: Nothing wrong. It’s the VIP from last time. She specifically asked for him.]","The group fell silent again for two seconds.","[Bartender—Kang: The same VIP who left a 100,000-yuan tip last time??? She’s back again???]","[Male Model—Zhao Lei: Let me do the math... 88,888 times three, with a 5% sales commission... That one order alone nets him over 23,000 in commission? Add in the previous 100,000-yuan tip... This intern has made more in half a month than I make in half a year???]"]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: How come you don't even know how to lift clothes","paragraphs":["【Male Model—Zhu Qichao: ...】","【Front Desk—Xiao Zhou: Makes even more than the male models. Comparing yourself to others really is maddening.】","【Male Model—Xu Yang: I’m not saying anything anymore.】","Yang Zhiyong locked his phone and hurried off to find Shen Wei.","When he pushed open the door to Private Room 208, Shen Wei was standing behind the bar, wiping glasses. The guests had already left, and two unopened bottles of liquor remained on the table.","“Xiaowei.”","Shen Wei looked up and gazed at him quietly.","Yang Zhiyong looked at that face, then at the receipt in his hand, and felt a complicated mix of emotions.","To be honest, he hadn’t thought much of Shen Wei when the boy had first arrived.","He was too reserved, spoke very little, and had no idea how to charm people. Even when promoting drinks, he sounded as though he were reciting from a textbook. Yang Zhiyong had originally thought someone with that kind of personality wouldn’t last a month at the club.","But what happened?","The kid didn’t need to know how to charm people. He had the kind of luck that attracted wealthy patrons.","“Xiaowei, ​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​​​​‌​‌‌​​​‌​​​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌​​​​​‌‌​​‌‌​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​​‌‍that VIP of yours is here again.” Yang Zhiyong patted him on the shoulder. “She’s waiting for you in VIP Room 3. Hand your work over to Kang and go over there now.”","The glass in Shen Wei’s hand paused.","“Which VIP?”","Yang Zhiyong stared at his blank expression and nearly shook him. “The one from last time! The lady who gave you a hundred thousand in tips!”","The tips of Shen Wei’s ears visibly turned red.","“She... came again?”","“She did! She’s waiting for you right now!” Yang Zhiyong urged him toward the door. “And she just took care of the remaining three bottles you had to sell. They’re 88,888 each—three bottles.”","Shen Wei stopped in his tracks.","He turned back to Yang Zhiyong, his expression momentarily blank.","“...88,888? Three bottles?”","“That’s right! Hurry up!”","Shen Wei was pushed out into the hallway. He lowered his head to look at his clothes, then raised a hand to touch his hair.","He stood there for two seconds before turning and heading to the restroom.","Five minutes later.","There was a knock on the door of VIP Room 3.","“Come in.”","The door opened gently, and Shen Wei stood in the doorway. His white shirt was tucked into his black trousers, the sleeves rolled up to the middle of his forearms, and his hair had been dampened and restyled.","Gu Lan was sprawled across the sofa, chewing on a grape. The moment she saw him enter, her eyes lit up.","“Come sit over here.”","Gu Lan patted the sofa beside her and beckoned Shen Wei over, her tone resembling someone calling over her pet cat.","Shen Wei remained standing in the doorway, the tips of his ears already turning pink.","Gu Lan tilted her head at him. “Why are you just standing there? I’m not going to eat you.”","She paused, then added, “Probably.”","Shen Wei pressed his lips together and walked over, sitting down beside her. He sat perfectly straight, knees together and back rigid, as though he were at a job interview.","Gu Lan shifted closer and leaned in to examine his face.","Up close, his skin really was flawless. His eyelashes were long too, casting a small shadow beneath his eyes whenever he lowered his gaze.","“You remember what you promised me last time, right?”","Shen Wei’s Adam’s apple bobbed.","“...I remember.”","“Then let me see.”","Gu Lan propped her chin on her hand and smiled at him.","Shen Wei lowered his eyes to his shirt. He pinched the hem, hesitated for two seconds, and then, as if completing an assigned task, abruptly lifted it.","The movement was brisk and decisive, but completely lacking in finesse.","It looked like he was at a medical checkup.","Gu Lan: “...”","Well, all right. The way he lifted his shirt was stiff and awkward, but his abs were the real deal.","The lines were clean and defined—not the exaggerated, blocky muscles deliberately sculpted in a gym, but the natural firmness of a young man’s body.","Just as Gu Lan reached out, someone knocked on the door.","“Your drinks are here—”","Yang Zhiyong pushed the door open, carrying a tray. Three bottles of matte black-and-gold whisky sat neatly arranged on it.","He looked up and saw Shen Wei with his shirt lifted and Gu Lan’s hand suspended in midair. His footsteps faltered.","Yang Zhiyong’s expression went blank for a brief moment before swiftly settling back into a professional smile.","“Did I come in too early?”","Shen Wei dropped his shirt as though he had been burned, his ears red enough to drip blood.","Gu Lan, however, wasn’t embarrassed in the slightest. She waved at Yang Zhiyong. “It’s fine. Come in.”","Yang Zhiyong set the drinks down, stealing a glance at Shen Wei’s stiff posture from the corner of his eye. He couldn’t help sighing inwardly.","This kid... really had no idea what he was doing.","He lifted his shirt like he was getting an ultrasound at the hospital. What guest could possibly enjoy that?","As he was thinking this, Gu Lan spoke.","“Brother Yang, can I ask you something?”","“Of course.”","“What do your male models usually train for here?”","Yang Zhiyong froze and instinctively glanced at Shen Wei.","“Training? Well... how to chat with guests, how to liven up the atmosphere, how to make guests happy.” He carefully considered his wording. “Basically, it’s an emotional-intelligence course.”","Gu Lan nodded, then asked, “Has Shen Wei had that training?”","The corners of Yang Zhiyong’s mouth twitched.","“He’s a bartender. He’s never taken the male-model training course.”","Gu Lan looked at Shen Wei, who was sitting beside her as stiffly as a wooden post, then looked back at Yang Zhiyong. Her eyes turned thoughtfully.","“Can you find someone experienced to teach him now?”","Yang Zhiyong: “...Teach him?”","“Yes, a live demonstration.” Gu Lan leaned back against the sofa, her tone as casual as if she were ordering takeout. “I want to see.”","“Yes, yes, we have someone!” Yang Zhiyong immediately nodded. “Our top performer happens to be here today. I’ll have him come teach. Please wait a moment.”","He turned and left the room, walking quickly toward the end of the hallway.","After rounding the corner, Yang Zhiyong pulled out his phone and checked the staff schedule before heading straight for the break room.","When he pushed open the door, Mu Sinian was leaning against a single-person sofa in the corner with his eyes closed, resting.","He wore a black velvet shirt buttoned all the way to the top.","His face was unnaturally pale, and even his lips were nearly colorless. He looked as though someone had just removed his IV and sent him straight from a hospital bed to work.","In reality, that was not far from the truth.","Yang Zhiyong walked over and lowered his voice. “Brother Mu, I’ve got a job for you.”","Mu Sinian didn’t open his eyes. “What kind of job?”","“There’s a rich lady in VIP Room 3 who wants you to give a live demonstration on how to serve a newcomer.” Yang Zhiyong crouched beside him and leaned closer. “It’s easy work. You just sit there, move your lips a little, and teach him how to chat with a guest. If you’re lucky, there might even be some extra spending.”","Mu Sinian’s eyelids twitched, but he still didn’t open them.","“Lady Wang just booked me.”","Yang Zhiyong’s expression shifted subtly for a moment.","Lady Wang. In her early forties, divorced, and fairly generous—but far too demanding. Last month, she had forced Mu Sinian to drink all night, sending him straight to the hospital to have his stomach pumped.","And lately, Lady Wang’s tips had clearly been shrinking, dropping from fifteen thousand to eight thousand. The last time, she had given him only five thousand.","Yang Zhiyong patted Mu Sinian on the shoulder. “I’ll ask Lady Wang to let you off. I’ll say your health hasn’t fully recovered and that you can’t take a long booking tonight.”","Mu Sinian finally opened his eyes.","They were a very pale color, carrying the weariness unique to someone who had recently recovered from an illness.","“What kind of customer is it?”","“A young woman, a college student.” Yang Zhiyong held up three fingers. “She just bought three bottles of 88,888-yuan liquor in one go.”","At last, a flicker of interest appeared in Mu Sinian’s eyes.","“...A college student?”","“Right. The one who gave Shen Wei a hundred thousand in tips last time.” Yang Zhiyong stood up. “You’ll just teach Xiaowei how to chat with a guest, sit there drinking and eating fruit. It’ll be a hundred times easier than taking care of Lady Wang.”","Mu Sinian was silent for two seconds before standing up.","“Fine.”"]}]);
